  ". Hanya email admin di ID token yang diterima aturan Firestore. Batas 500 transaksi uji coba TIDAK ditegakkan aturan (bahasa aturan tidak bisa menghitung dokumen) — penegakannya lewat sapuan meteran ini, jadi sebuah outlet bisa sesaat melewati batas sebelum ditangguhkan. ⚠︎ Angka harga langganan bersifat indikatif, bukan tarif final.": ". Only an admin email in the ID token is accepted by the Firestore rules. The 500-transaction trial limit is NOT enforced by the rules (the rules language cannot count documents) — it is enforced by this meter sweep, so an outlet can briefly go past the limit before it is suspended. ⚠︎ Subscription prices are indicative, not final rates.",
