  "Halaman ini hanya membaca. Semua angka bisa dihitung ulang dari pesanan yang tersimpan, dan pesanan yang sudah diterima tidak bisa dihapus dari sisi kafe maupun pelanggan.": "This page only reads. Every figure can be recalculated from the stored orders, and an order that has been accepted cannot be deleted by the outlet or by the customer.",
