  "Peta pemilih batas lahan — ketuk untuk menetapkan titik tengah": "Land boundary picker map — tap to set the center point",
  "Ambang NDVI dan warnanya adalah parameter perencanaan, bukan hasil pengukuran lapangan. Nilainya wajib dikalibrasi per wilayah dan musim; NDVI juga jenuh pada tegakan rapat. Warna di peta menunjukkan tutupan yang": "NDVI thresholds and their colors are planning parameters, not field measurements. The values must be calibrated per region and season; NDVI also saturates on dense stands. The colors on the map show cover that is",
  "dari citra — bukan karbon yang sudah terverifikasi. Sertifikasi dan MRV masih ada di peta jalan.": "from imagery — not carbon that has been verified. Certification and MRV are still on the roadmap.",
  "Peta lahan": "Land map",
  "Dipakai bot pelanggan: menempel di celemek avatar dan di kepala halaman meja. Kalau kosong, bot memakai huruf pertama nama outlet — bukan kotak gambar rusak.": "Used by the customer bot: it appears on the avatar's apron and at the top of the table page. If empty, the bot uses the first letter of the outlet name — not a broken-image box.",
  "Pilih gambar logo outlet": "Choose outlet logo image",
  "Pratinjau logo outlet": "Outlet logo preview",
  "Tidak ada dokumen pendaftaran untuk outlet ini. Wajar untuk outlet yang dibuat sebelum kolom pendaftaran ada — bukan tanda ada yang salah.": "No registration documents for this outlet. That is normal for outlets created before the registration fields existed — not a sign that something is wrong.",
  "Outlet ini mendaftar tanpa unggahan KTP/NIB — memang begitu alur pendaftarannya sejak ronde 30 (uji coba swalayan, seperti layanan digital pada umumnya). Verifikasi identitas diminta lewat jalur tersendiri bila outlet naik ke layanan berbayar atau menerima penyaluran dana.": "This outlet registered without uploading a KTP/NIB — that is how registration has worked since round 30 (self-service trial, like most digital services). Identity verification is requested through a separate path if the outlet moves up to a paid service or receives fund disbursements.",
  "Tampil ke pelanggan di panel bayar-sekarang saat mereka memindai QR meja. Pakai gambar QRIS statis milik outlet Anda.": "Shown to customers in the pay-now panel when they scan the table QR. Use your outlet's own static QRIS image.",
  "Mengambil QRIS dari penyimpanan…": "Fetching QRIS from storage…",
  "QRIS yang tercatat masih yang sebelumnya — gambar yang barusan Anda pilih belum tersimpan.": "The recorded QRIS is still the previous one — the image you just picked has not been saved.",
  "Hapus QRIS? Pelanggan tidak akan lagi melihatnya di panel bayar-sekarang dan harus membayar di kasir. Gambar bisa diunggah lagi kapan saja.": "Remove QRIS? Customers will no longer see it in the pay-now panel and will have to pay at the payment point. The image can be uploaded again at any time.",
  "Hapus QRIS": "Remove QRIS",
  "Pastikan kode benar-benar milik outlet Anda dan masih aktif. Mengganti QRIS membuat salinan baru; yang lama berhenti dipakai begitu yang baru tersimpan.": "Make sure the code really belongs to your outlet and is still active. Replacing the QRIS creates a new copy; the old one stops being used as soon as the new one is saved.",
  "Pratinjau QRIS pembayaran outlet": "Outlet payment QRIS preview",
