  "Katalog pohon": "Tree catalog",
  "Data pohon per batang (diameter + tinggi → CO₂e alometri Chave 2014 ⚠︎). Bisa diukur dari foto lewat peramban, dientri manual, atau diimpor CSV/JSON dari drone — lalu disunting kapan saja saat pohonnya diukur ulang.": "Per-tree data (diameter + height → CO₂e, Chave 2014 allometry ⚠︎). Can be measured from a photo in the browser, entered by hand, or imported as CSV/JSON from a drone — then edited any time the tree is measured again.",
