  "⚠︎ Kecocokan namanya lemah atau ada kandidat lain yang sama kuat. Periksa daftarnya — kalau yang benar bukan ini, pilih sendiri di atas.": "⚠︎ The name match is weak, or another candidate is just as strong. Check the list — if this is not the right one, choose it yourself above.",
  "Belum ada faktor untuk bahan ini. Menu yang memakainya akan berbunyi \"karbon belum dihitung\" — itu benar, dan lebih jujur daripada menampilkan nol. Pilih dari daftar di atas kalau Anda tahu padanannya.": "There is no factor for this ingredient yet. Any menu item using it will read “carbon not yet calculated” — that is correct, and more honest than showing zero. Pick from the list above if you know the equivalent.",
  "belum punya faktor karbon": "have no carbon factor yet",
  ". Setiap menu yang memakainya akan berbunyi \"karbon belum dihitung\" — itu benar dan sengaja, sebab menampilkan nol berarti mengklaim menu itu tanpa emisi. Buka \"✏️ Ubah\" pada bahannya; kolom faktornya sudah menawarkan tebakan dari namanya, Anda tinggal memastikan.": ". Every menu item using them will read “carbon not yet calculated” — that is correct and deliberate, because showing zero would claim the item has no emissions. Open “✏️ Edit” on the ingredient; the factor field already offers a guess from its name, you only need to confirm it.",
  "bahan contoh": "sample ingredients",
  "bawaan Glyiv (namanya berakhiran \"(Contoh)\"). ⚠︎ Harga, stok, dan nilai stok di kartu atas": "built into Glyiv (their names end in “(Contoh)”). ⚠︎ The price, stock, and stock value in the cards above",
  "sudah termasuk bahan contoh itu": "already include those sample ingredients",
  ", jadi angkanya belum menggambarkan gudang Anda. Buang semuanya sekaligus lewat tombol \"Buang semua data contoh\" di tab Menu begitu Anda tidak memerlukannya.": ", so the figures do not yet describe your own store. Discard them all at once with the “Discard all sample data” button on the Menu tab as soon as you no longer need them.",
  "🌱 faktor karbon belum diisi": "🌱 carbon factor not filled in yet",
  "pesanan contoh": "sample orders",
  "belum menggambarkan penjualan Anda": "do not yet describe your own sales",
  "selama contohnya masih ada.": "for as long as the samples remain.",
  "Pesanan contoh": "Sample orders",
  "tidak dihitung sebagai transaksi di tagihan Anda": "are not counted as transactions on your bill",
  ". Pesanan dari pelanggan sungguhan tidak bisa dihapus siapa pun kecuali Glyiv — ia adalah dasar tagihan, dan angka yang bisa dirapikan pihak yang ditagih bukan dasar apa pun.": ". Orders from real customers cannot be deleted by anyone except Glyiv — they are the basis of billing, and a figure the billed party can tidy up is not a basis for anything.",
  "Ulasan pelanggan sungguhan tidak bisa disunting maupun dihapus dari halaman ini, dan itu disengaja — kesaksian tidak boleh diubah oleh pihak yang disaksikan; aturan di server yang menegakkannya, bukan tombol yang disembunyikan. Yang bisa Anda hapus hanya ulasan bertanda \"contoh\", yaitu data peragaan yang dipasang Glyiv sendiri. Membalas ulasan juga belum tersedia: belum ada tempat menyimpan balasan, jadi tombolnya tidak dibuat alih-alih menjanjikan kiriman yang tidak sampai ke mana pun. Nomor meja dan kode pesanan (mis. \"ZM-VYC2\") tidak tersimpan di dokumen ulasan, sehingga yang bisa ditampilkan hanya ID pesanan.": "Reviews from real customers cannot be edited or deleted from this page, and that is deliberate — testimony must not be altered by the party being testified about; it is the server rules that enforce this, not a hidden button. The only ones you can delete are reviews marked “contoh”, the demonstration data Glyiv installed itself. Replying to reviews is not available yet either: there is nowhere to store a reply, so the button was not built rather than promising a message that goes nowhere. The table number and order code (e.g. “ZM-VYC2”) are not stored on the review document, so only the order ID can be shown.",
  "Namanya berakhiran \"(Contoh)\" di setiap layar.": "Their names end in “(Contoh)” on every screen.",
  "Contoh dipasang supaya Anda bisa melihat kaitan antar-menu: bahan punya faktor karbon, resep menjumlahkannya jadi jejak per menu, pesanan mengisi Rekap. Ubah apa pun yang berguna, atau buang semuanya sekaligus. ⚠︎ Seluruh angkanya angka contoh, bukan angka Anda.": "The samples are installed so you can see how things connect: ingredients carry a carbon factor, recipes add them up into a footprint per menu item, and orders fill the Summary. Change whatever is useful, or discard it all at once. ⚠︎ Every figure here is a sample figure, not yours.",
  "Pesanan contoh TIDAK dihitung sebagai transaksi di tagihan Anda. Jejak perubahan stoknya tetap tercatat di Bahan &amp; stok walau bahannya dibuang — jejak memang tidak bisa dihapus siapa pun, dan barisnya menyebut dirinya data contoh.": "Sample orders are NOT counted as transactions on your bill. Their stock movements stay recorded in Ingredients &amp; stock even after the ingredients are discarded — a trail genuinely cannot be deleted by anyone, and the row says of itself that it is sample data.",
  "⚠︎ Menu contoh ikut dinyalakan supaya pesanan contohnya masuk akal, jadi ia akan terlihat di halaman pelanggan Anda — namanya berakhiran \"(Contoh)\". Pesanan contoh tidak dihitung sebagai transaksi di tagihan.": "⚠︎ Sample menu items are switched on too so that the sample orders make sense, so they will be visible on your customer page — their names end in “(Contoh)”. Sample orders are not counted as transactions on the bill.",
