  "\"Karbon yang bisa diaudit ke sumbernya adalah fondasi ekonomi rendah-karbon yang jujur — dan kami membangunnya untuk dunia.\"": "\"Carbon that can be audited back to its source is the foundation of an honest low-carbon economy — and we are building it for the world.\"",
  "“Pindai” di Glyiv berarti": "“Scan” at Glyiv means",
  "“pindai” di Glyiv berarti mencari barang di pustaka faktor emisi dari namanya": "“scan” in Glyiv means looking an item up in the emission factor library by its name",
  "\"Saya sudah datang\"": "\"I'm here\"",
  "(≈ 1 km motor)": "(≈ 1 km by motorbike)",
  "(2018) & ADEME Agribalyse. Dua angka berikut ilustratif ⚠︎, dipakai hanya untuk pratinjau label: harga karbon ≈Rp70.000/tCO₂e, dan serapan 1 pohon dewasa ≈22 kg CO₂ per tahun — keduanya bervariasi menurut pasar, spesies, dan umur tegakan. Semua angka pratinjau — bukan klaim netral karbon, melainkan kontribusi yang bisa dipertanggungjawabkan.": "(2018) & ADEME Agribalyse. The next two figures are illustrative ⚠︎, used only for the label preview: a carbon price of ≈Rp70,000/tCO₂e, and absorption by 1 mature tree of ≈22 kg CO₂ per year — both vary with market, species, and stand age. All figures are preview values — not a carbon neutral claim, but a contribution that can be defended.",
  "(belum termasuk transport/barang/penerbangan); mengabaikan food waste, asal & musim bahan, metode masak. ⚠︎ EF pangan default dari studi global/AS — faktor Indonesia (nasi sebagai staple, lahan gambut) bisa berbeda. Tidak valid untuk anak/hamil/kondisi metabolik khusus. Bukan nasihat medis.": "(transport/goods/flights not yet included); it ignores food waste, ingredient origin & season, and cooking method. ⚠︎ Default food EFs come from global/US studies — Indonesian factors (rice as a staple, peatland) may differ. Not valid for children/pregnancy/special metabolic conditions. Not medical advice.",
  "(Command Prompt, di folder tempat berkasnya berada):": "(Command Prompt, in the folder where the file sits):",
  "(gambar batas petak, hitung luas, estimasi serapan berentang, baca tutupan lewat segmentasi indeks vegetasi) dan": "(draw the plot boundary, compute the area, estimate absorption as a range, read canopy cover through vegetation-index segmentation) and",
  "(minim kecurangan). Sistem": "(minimal cheating). The system",
  "(pohon virtual, poin, serta pasar kebutuhan perusahaan yang dibangkitkan sistem — bukan klien dan bukan permintaan nyata). Nilai tutupan yang tampil di peta masih data contoh prototipe; asupan citra satelit rutin, sertifikasi pihak ketiga, dan pencatatan ke registri karbon masih peta jalan. Kontrak ERC-3643 berjalan di jaringan uji, belum jaringan utama.": "(virtual trees, points, and a system-generated marketplace of corporate needs — not clients and not real demand). The canopy cover values shown on the map are still prototype sample data; routine satellite imagery intake, third-party certification, and recording into a carbon registry are still roadmap. The ERC-3643 contract runs on a test network, not yet the main network.",
  "(POS kafe), kami melihat tiap item — bukan sekadar \"Rp50.000 di sebuah kafe\". Inilah aset yang dicari institusi besar dan, kelak, pasar karbon internasional.": "(the cafe POS), we see every item — not just “Rp50,000 at a cafe.” This is the asset large institutions — and eventually, international carbon markets — are looking for.",
  "(POS outlet), kami melihat tiap item — bukan sekadar “Rp50.000 di sebuah outlet”. Inilah aset yang dicari institusi besar dan, kelak, pasar karbon internasional.": "(the outlet POS), we see every item — not just “Rp50,000 at some outlet.” This is the asset large institutions — and eventually, international carbon markets — are looking for.",
  "(simulasi)": "(simulation)",
  "(TDEE/1000) × faktor emisi pangan (Poore & Nemecek 2018) × 365 = jejak diet tahunan.": "(TDEE/1000) × food emission factor (Poore & Nemecek 2018) × 365 = annual diet footprint.",
  "(WHO/IASO/IOTF 2000 — ambang yang juga dipakai materi P2PTM Kemenkes) menurunkan batas risikonya ke 23, karena pada tubuh Asia risiko metabolik naik pada IMT yang lebih rendah. ⚠︎ Sebagian publikasi Kemenkes yang lebih lama memakai pembagian berbeda lagi (17,0 / 18,5 / 25,0 / 27,0), jadi kategori bisa berbeda antar-rujukan.": "(WHO/IASO/IOTF 2000 — the threshold also used in Kemenkes P2PTM material) lowers the risk cut-off to 23, because in Asian bodies metabolic risk rises at a lower BMI. ⚠︎ Some older Kemenkes publications use yet another split (17.0 / 18.5 / 25.0 / 27.0), so the category can differ between references.",
  "& Jejak Karbon": "& carbon footprint",
  "% — lebih lebar, mengikuti tier": "% — wider, following the tier",
  "% biasanya berarti zona atau kolomnya salah, bukan sertifikatnya. Periksa lagi sebelum memakai batas ini.": "% usually means the zone or the columns are wrong, not the certificate. Check again before using this boundary.",
