  "⚠︎ Agenda riset jangka panjang — belum berjalan, dan belum ada material yang kami jual. Yang kami tuju: riset material alternatif rendah-karbon agar industri memangkas jejaknya dari akar proses, bukan hanya menutupinya.": "⚠︎ A long-term research agenda — not running yet, and there is no material we sell. What we are aiming at: research into low-carbon alternative materials so industry cuts its footprint at the root of the process, not merely covers it over.",
