  "⚠ Demo interaktif · harga, poin & CO₂e adalah": "⚠ Interactive demo · prices, points & CO₂e are",
  "⚠︎ Emisi yang dihindari per ton material daur ulang campuran dibanding ditimbun (baseline AS; perlu penyesuaian konteks TPA Indonesia)": "⚠︎ Emissions avoided per tonne of mixed recycled material versus landfilling (US baseline; needs adjustment for the Indonesian landfill context)",
  "⚠︎ Empat belas petak di peta ini adalah": "⚠︎ The fourteen plots on this map are",
  "⚠︎ Estimasi industri (green economy & carbon market outlook). Ditampilkan sebagai skala peluang, bukan proyeksi Glyiv.": "⚠︎ Industry estimates (green economy & carbon-market outlook). Shown as opportunity scale, not Glyiv projections.",
  "⚠︎ Estimasi terhindar bersifat ilustrasi & bersumber (kategori). Kontribusi terlacak, bukan klaim netral.": "⚠︎ Avoided estimates are illustrative & sourced (category level). Contribution is tracked, not a neutrality claim.",
  "⚠︎ Estimasi, bukan sertifikasi. Jalur harga (EXIOBASE) paling lemah (sensitif diskon/premium, bisa meleset puluhan %). Berat dari foto rapuh tanpa acuan skala. Database condong Eropa — faktor Indonesia bisa berbeda. Mendukung \"kontribusi/jejak terlacak\" untuk imbalan Glyiv, bukan klaim netral karbon.": "⚠︎ An estimate, not a certification. The price pathway (EXIOBASE) is the weakest (sensitive to discounts/premiums, can be off by tens of %). Weight from a photo is fragile without a scale reference. The database skews European — Indonesian factors may differ. It supports \"contribution / tracked footprint\" for Glyiv rewards, not a carbon neutral claim.",
  "⚠︎ Faktor emisi grid PLN bersifat ilustrasi — di produksi diambil dari data jaringan terkini.": "⚠︎ The PLN grid emission factor is illustrative — in production it is taken from the latest grid data.",
  "⚠︎ Halaman ini": "⚠︎ This page",
  "⚠︎ Halaman kalkulator Glyiv yang lama (": "⚠︎ The old Glyiv calculator page (",
  "⚠︎ Ilustrasi produk · angka contoh": "⚠︎ Product illustration · sample figures",
  "⚠︎ Ilustrasi rancangan · angka contoh": "⚠︎ Design illustration · sample figures",
  "⚠︎ Ini": "⚠︎ This is",
  "⚠︎ Ini alat bantu estimasi, bukan pengukuran instrumen. Akurasinya bergantung pada objek acuan yang sebidang dengan batang dan foto yang diambil tegak lurus. Hasilnya tidak membuat kontribusi apa pun menjadi terverifikasi — verifikasi pihak ketiga masih peta jalan.": "⚠︎ This is an estimate aid, not an instrument reading. Its accuracy depends on a reference object in the same plane as the trunk and on a photo taken perpendicular to it. The result does not make any contribution verified — third-party verification is still on the roadmap.",
  "⚠︎ Kolom di atas terisi": "⚠︎ The fields above are filled with",
  "⚠︎ perkiraan": "⚠︎ estimate",
  "⚠︎ Perkiraan kasar ±900 batang/ha, satu angka untuk semua spesies — belum dikalibrasi lapangan dan belum bersumber literatur. Dipakai sama persis di katalog pohon Glyiv.": "⚠︎ A rough approximation of ±900 stems/ha, one figure for every species — not field-calibrated and not sourced from literature. Used identically in the Glyiv tree catalogue.",
  "⚠︎ Pohon & angkanya permainan — buka penjelasan dan angka terukurnya": "⚠︎ The trees and their numbers are a game — open for the explanation and the on-screen rendering figures",
  "⚠ Pratinjau produk · pendapatan, pesanan & CO₂e di papan ini adalah angka ilustrasi dari data contoh · CO₂e terlacak, bukan terukur, bukan terverifikasi · sertifikasi, MRV & registry masih roadmap.": "⚠ Product preview · the revenue, orders & CO₂e on this board are illustrative figures from sample data · CO₂e is traceable, not measured, not verified · certification, MRV & registry are still roadmap.",
  "⚠︎ Rentang kebutuhan tiap sektor adalah angka permainan yang dipilih sekadar agar kartu tidak seragam. Ia BUKAN data emisi sektor mana pun, tidak diambil dari inventarisasi emisi mana pun, dan tidak boleh dikutip.": "⚠︎ Each sector's requirement range is a game figure picked only so the cards are not identical. It is NOT emissions data for any sector, is not taken from any emissions inventory, and must not be quoted.",
  "⚠︎ Semua hitungan memakai elipsoid WGS84. Sertifikat Indonesia memakai DGN95/SRGI2013, yang di sini diperlakukan sama — selisihnya di bawah ±1 meter, tetapi itu perkiraan, bukan transformasi datum. Untuk batas yang dipersengketakan, angka ini tidak cukup.": "⚠︎ Every computation uses the WGS84 ellipsoid. Indonesian certificates use DGN95/SRGI2013, treated here as the same — the difference is under ±1 metre, but that is an approximation, not a datum transformation. For a disputed boundary, this number is not enough.",
  "⚠︎ Sesi ini saja. Tidak masuk dompet, tidak bernilai rupiah.": "⚠︎ This session only. It does not enter the wallet and is worth no rupiah.",
  "⚠︎ Terus terang: vertikal Toko & UMKM masih dalam pengembangan. Kalkulator per item di halaman ini sudah berjalan; program karbon UMKM selengkapnya — pendampingan, laporan berkala, penyaluran offset — masih kami bangun.": "⚠︎ Plainly: the Retail & MSME vertical is still under development. The per-item calculator on this page is live; the fuller MSME carbon programme — mentoring, periodic reporting, offset channelling — is still being built.",
  "⚠︎, bukan pengukuran dan bukan hasil verifikasi pihak ketiga.": "⚠︎, not instrument readings and not third-party verified results.",
  "⚠︎. Butuh gambaran menyeluruh? Jadwalkan demo.": "⚠︎. Need the whole picture? Book a demo.",
