  "adalah turunan populer yang dipakai kalkulator gizi, bukan kutipan langsung tabel PAL FAO/WHO/UNU 2004 (yang memberi rentang per kategori: sedentari/ringan 1,40–1,69; sedang 1,70–1,99; berat 2,00–2,40). Nilai 1,2 di sini berada di bawah batas bawah FAO/WHO/UNU, artinya kategori “sedentari” di halaman ini lebih konservatif daripada tabel itu.": "is a popular derivative used by nutrition calculators, not a direct quotation of the FAO/WHO/UNU 2004 PAL table (which gives a range per category: sedentary/light 1.40–1.69; moderate 1.70–1.99; heavy 2.00–2.40). The value 1.2 here sits below the FAO/WHO/UNU lower bound, meaning the “sedentary” category on this page is more conservative than that table.",
  "Add-on jejak karbon": "Carbon footprint add-on",
  "Admin Glyiv": "Glyiv admins",
  "Aduh, harus antri 😩": "Ugh, have to queue 😩",
  "Agen AI": "AI agents",
  "Agen AI membaca pola pemakaian, menandai pemborosan dan kesalahan pilah, lalu memberi saran konkret—misalnya menaikkan setpoint AC beberapa derajat atau memperbaiki pemisahan organik—sehingga penghematan menjadi tindakan, bukan sekadar laporan.": "An AI agent reads usage patterns, flags waste and sorting errors, then gives concrete suggestions—raising the AC setpoint by a few degrees, say, or fixing organic separation—so that saving becomes action, not just a report.",
  "Agen AI membersihkan dan mengklasifikasikan jutaan judul produk yang tidak terstruktur, mencocokkannya ke kategori emisi, dan menandai anomali agar estimasi tetap konsisten dan bisa diaudit.": "AI agents clean and classify millions of unstructured product titles, match them to emission categories, and flag anomalies so estimates stay consistent and auditable.",
  "Agen AI memeriksa silang citra satelit, data registri, dan dokumen proyek; menilai risiko permanensi serta kebocoran; menandai anomali dan menyematkan ⚠︎ pada klaim yang belum bisa dipertanggungjawabkan sebelum aset masuk portofolio.": "An AI agent cross-checks satellite imagery, registry data, and project documents; assesses permanence and leakage risk; flags anomalies and attaches ⚠︎ to any claim that cannot yet be stood behind, before an asset enters the portfolio.",
  "Agen AI memvalidasi kesesuaian jenis dan bobot, mendeteksi anomali atau input ganda, mengelompokkan aliran material, lalu menyusun estimasi kontribusi per nasabah dan per komunitas secara otomatis.": "An AI agent validates that type and weight match, detects anomalies or duplicate entries, groups material streams, then compiles a contribution estimate per member and per community automatically.",
  "Agen AI menghitung": "The AI agent computes",
  "Agen AI menyusun kursus, media, dan kuis yang dipersonalisasi dari hasil jejak serta jawaban Anda, sengaja menyorot aksi berdampak tinggi yang kerap terlewat di kurikulum arus utama.": "AI agents assemble personalised courses, media, and quizzes from your footprint results and your answers, deliberately highlighting the high-impact actions that mainstream curricula usually miss.",
  "Agen AI meringkas jejak per kategori, menandai belanja berjejak tinggi, dan menjelaskan penyebabnya dalam bahasa yang bisa langsung Anda tindak lanjuti—bukan sekadar deretan angka.": "AI agents summarise the footprint by category, flag high-footprint purchases, and explain the cause in language you can act on straight away—not just a row of numbers.",
  "Agen Glyiv memantau kinerja & risiko, merekomendasikan rebalancing.": "The Glyiv agent monitors performance & risk and recommends rebalancing.",
  "Agen Glyiv menandai anomali": "The Glyiv agent flags anomalies",
  "Agen Glyiv menandai anomali, membandingkan emisi terhadap biaya, dan menemukan pemborosan yang diam-diam menggerus laba — lalu merekomendasikan tindakannya, lengkap dengan alasan dan data yang mendasarinya. Keputusan tetap di tangan Anda.": "The Glyiv agent flags anomalies, weighs emissions against cost, and finds the waste quietly eating into profit — then recommends the action, complete with the reasoning and the data behind it. The decision stays yours.",
  "Agen Glyiv menemukan": "The Glyiv agent finds",
