  "Anda dapat anggaran karbon bulanan; agen memberi nudge hemat saat mendekati batas.": "You get a monthly carbon budget; the agent nudges you to save as you near the limit.",
  "Anda melihat imbal hasil ⚠︎ dan dampak karbon nyata dari portofolio — keduanya terlacak.": "You see the return ⚠︎ and the real carbon impact of the portfolio — both tracked.",
  "Anda memotret batang bersama benda berukuran diketahui di bidang yang sama (penggaris 30 cm, kertas A4, atau orang setinggi ±170 cm), lalu menandai empat titik di layar. Skalanya dihitung dari benda acuan itu. Jalan di HP dan tablet mana pun, tanpa memasang apa pun. Alatnya ada di katalog pohon sebuah lahan di dalam konsol Glyiv.": "You photograph the trunk together with an object of known size in the same plane (a 30 cm ruler, an A4 sheet, or a person about ±170 cm tall), then mark four points on the screen. The scale is derived from that reference object. It runs on any phone or tablet, with nothing to install. The tool sits in the tree catalogue of a piece of land inside the Glyiv console.",
  "Anda pakai": "right away",
  "Anda sedang tanpa jaringan. Mengukur & menyimpan tetap jalan; unggahan menunggu sampai sinyal kembali.": "You are offline. Measuring and saving still work; uploads wait until the signal returns.",
