  "Aset yang lolos uji disusun menjadi unit RWA yang transparan, lalu dialokasikan lintas reksa dana pohon, kredit karbon, dan energi terbarukan sesuai profil risiko–dampak yang Anda pilih.": "Assets that pass due diligence are structured into transparent RWA units, then allocated across tree funds, carbon credits, and renewable energy according to the risk–impact profile you choose.",
