  "beban listrik tetap yang jalan terus meski omzet turun — pemborosan paling umum dan paling mudah ditutup": "a fixed electricity load that keeps running even when turnover falls — the most common waste, and the easiest to close",
  "Beban puncak tak diratakan — tarif melonjak": "Peak load not levelled — tariffs spike",
  "bebas": "free",
  "Begini rancangannya bekerja. Di titik setor kampus, sampah kamu ditimbang dan diklasifikasi per jenis material, lalu nilainya langsung masuk sebagai kredit digital di dompet Glyiv. Setiap transaksi tercatat rapi: berapa kilogram, material apa, dan ke mana ia disalurkan. Memilah berhenti menjadi kewajiban abstrak dan berubah menjadi tabungan yang bisa kamu lihat tumbuh.": "Here is how the design works. At the campus drop-off point, your waste is weighed and classified by material type, and its value goes straight into your Glyiv wallet as digital credit. Every transaction is recorded cleanly: how many kilograms, which material, and where it was sent. Sorting stops being an abstract duty and becomes savings you can watch grow.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv Belajar merangkai kursus singkat, media naratif, game, dan kuis literasi ke dalam satu jalur yang mengalir. Setiap materi bertaut dengan jejak karbon aktivitas harian Anda sendiri. Konsep abstrak pun berubah menjadi angka yang relevan dan keputusan yang bisa diambil hari ini.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv Learn strings short courses, narrative media, games, and literacy quizzes into one flowing path. Every piece of material connects to the carbon footprint of your own daily activity. Abstract concepts turn into relevant numbers and decisions you can act on today.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv Dana menstrukturkan aset hijau sebagai Real-World Asset (RWA): setiap unit pohon, kredit karbon, dan proyek energi terbarukan tertaut ke aktivitas fisik yang dapat dilacak. Kami memakai metodologi activity-based LCA — aktivitas dikalikan faktor emisi dari ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek (2018), Agribalyse, DEFRA, dan IPCC — dengan fallback spend-based EEIO (EXIOBASE) bila data aktivitas belum lengkap. Hasilnya: imbalan yang jujur, dilaporkan sebagai kontribusi yang terlacak, bukan klaim netral karbon.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv Funds structures green assets as Real-World Assets (RWA): every tree unit, carbon credit, and renewable energy project is linked to physical activity that can be tracked. We use an activity-based LCA methodology — activity multiplied by emission factors from ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek (2018), Agribalyse, DEFRA, and the IPCC — with a spend-based EEIO fallback (EXIOBASE) where activity data is not yet complete. The result: an honest reward, reported as a tracked contribution, not a carbon neutral claim.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv Dompet menempelkan estimasi jejak karbon pada setiap pembayaran, otomatis, tanpa mengubah kebiasaan Anda. Kontribusi offset dan bukti aksi hijau Anda tersimpan sebagai aset hijau dalam custody yang bisa ditelusuri kapan saja—terlacak, bukan sekadar diklaim.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv Pocket attaches a carbon footprint estimate to every payment, automatically, without changing your habits. Your offsetting contributions and proof of green action are held as green assets in custody, traceable at any time—tracked, not merely claimed.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv IoT menempatkan sensor tepat di titik keputusan: AC hemat yang mendinginkan seperlunya, smart meter yang membaca konsumsi per perangkat, dan tempat sampah pintar ESP32 dengan pengenalan citra plus servo penyortir yang memilah sampah saat dibuang. Setiap perangkat menjadi simpul DePIN—infrastruktur fisik yang dijalankan komunitas dan mencatat kontribusinya secara transparan. Bukan menambah beban, tapi menjadikan aksi sehari-hari terbaca.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv IoT places sensors exactly at the point of decision: efficient air conditioning that cools only as much as needed, a smart meter that reads consumption per device, and an ESP32 smart bin with image recognition plus a sorting servo that separates waste at the moment it is thrown away. Every device becomes a DePIN node—physical infrastructure run by the community, recording its contribution transparently. Not an added burden, but everyday action made legible.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv Pasar melekatkan estimasi emisi pada setiap produk, dihitung transparan dari data aktivitas dan faktor emisi standar internasional, bukan angka pemasaran. Kami sengaja memilih kata terlacak, bukan terukur, karena estimasi yang jujur lebih berguna daripada klaim yang sempurna. Konsumen akhirnya bisa membandingkan bukan hanya harga, tapi juga dampak.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv Market attaches an emissions estimate to every product, computed transparently from activity data and international standard emission factors, not a marketing number. We deliberately chose the word tracked, not measured, because an honest estimate is more useful than a perfect claim. Consumers can finally compare not only price, but impact.",
  "Begini rancangannya. Glyiv Sehat mencatat perjalanan aktif dan pilihan makan nabati Anda, lalu menautkannya ke faktor emisi tepercaya. Manfaat kesehatan tetap sepenuhnya milik Anda; jejak karbon yang lebih ringan menjadi kontribusi yang terlacak, bukan klaim kosong. Setiap kebiasaan baik berbuah imbalan nyata, bukan sekadar lencana.": "Here is how it is designed. Glyiv Health records your active travel and plant-based food choices, then links them to trusted emission factors. The health benefit stays entirely yours; the lighter carbon footprint becomes a tracked contribution, not an empty claim. Every good habit yields a real reward, not merely a badge.",
  "Beginilah rasanya": "This is how it feels",
  "begitu didaftarkan. Tim Glyiv meninjau pendaftarannya setelah itu — peninjauan tidak menghentikan uji coba, tetapi Glyiv berhak menghentikan layanan bila outlet dipakai di luar ketentuan. Angka karbon yang dihasilkan sistem ini": "as soon as it is registered. The Glyiv team reviews the registration afterwards — the review does not stop the trial, but Glyiv may end the service if the outlet is used outside the terms. The carbon figures this system produces are",
