  "berizin dengan KYC/AML. Retail dapat menebus sebagian; korporasi mendanai & menebus — kebijakan kami: hanya mencantumkan kredit dari standar diakui (Verra, Gold Standard) & prioritas ICVCM CCP, selaras registri (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK); semuanya masih peta jalan. Glyiv adalah lapisan data & procurement,": "permissioned rails with KYC/AML. Retail can redeem a fraction; corporates fund & retire — our policy: list only credits from recognized standards (Verra, Gold Standard) & prioritize ICVCM CCP, aligned with the registries (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK); all of it still roadmap. Glyiv is the data & procurement layer,",
