  "Carbon API menyerap data dari ERP, meteran energi, invoice (AI-OCR) hingga satelit — menghitung Scope 1/2/3 selaras GHG Protocol & ISO 14064. Data masuk sekali, dipakai untuk semua laporan. Tanpa spreadsheet — tiap angka tetap terlacak ke sumbernya.": "The Carbon API ingests data from ERP, energy meters, invoices (AI-OCR) through to satellites — computing Scope 1/2/3 in line with the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064. Data goes in once and serves every report. No spreadsheets — every figure stays tracked back to its source.",
  "Carbon API menyerap ERP, meteran energi, invoice (AI-OCR), hingga satelit — otomatis, tanpa spreadsheet.": "The Carbon API ingests ERP, energy meters, invoices (AI-OCR), even satellites — automatically, no spreadsheets.",
  "Carbon Flow · thesis Glyiv": "Carbon Flow · the Glyiv thesis",
  "Carbon ledger otomatis jadi dashboard ESG siap-audit untuk bisnis. NDVI + citra Sentinel memantau kondisi pohon & mendeteksi anomali (alert deforestasi). Catatan jujur: NDVI bukan “meteran karbon” — akurasi grade-kredit butuh kalibrasi lapangan (selaras IPCC).": "The carbon ledger automatically becomes an audit-ready ESG dashboard for businesses. NDVI + Sentinel imagery track tree health & flag anomalies (deforestation alerts). An honest note: NDVI is not a “carbon meter” — credit-grade accuracy needs field calibration (aligned with IPCC).",
  "Carbon SaaS global": "Global carbon SaaS",
