  "Cukup alamat atau patokan yang bisa dikenali tim peninjau. Batas lahan yang dipakai sistem digambar admin dari peta saat peninjauan, bukan dari teks ini.": "An address or a landmark the review team can recognise is enough. The land boundary the system uses is drawn by an admin from the map during the review, not from this text.",
