  "Curhat ke Liv — dia mengenali preferensi, mood, dan cuaca, lalu menyarankan menu yang pas. Makin sering pesan, makin paham seleramu.": "Chat with Liv — she picks up on your preferences, mood, and the weather, then suggests exactly what you need. The more you order, the better she knows you.",
