  "dan bisa dibuka lagi besok.": "and can be opened again tomorrow.",
  "dan bisa ditelusuri sampai sumbernya.": "and traceable back to its source.",
  "dan bukan batas yang Anda gambar:": "and not a boundary you drew:",
  "dan bukan hasil sensus. Posisinya dihitung sistem dari perkiraan kerapatan tanam": "and not the result of a census. Positions are computed by the system from an estimated planting density",
  "dan datanya ikut hilang.": "and takes your data with it.",
  "dan emisi yang tak pernah tercatat": "and emissions that are never recorded",
  "dan jejak karbonnya": "and its carbon footprint",
  "dan pramusaji antar ke meja.": "and your server will bring it to your table.",
  "dan simulasi bursa — bukan kredit karbon yang bisa diperdagangkan di pasar teregulasi, dan bukan klaim \"netral karbon\". Segmentasi indeks tutupan sudah berjalan sebagai modul, tetapi nilainya masih data contoh prototipe ⚠︎; asupan citra satelit rutin, sertifikasi pihak ketiga, MRV independen, dan pencatatan registri ada dalam peta jalan. Perhitungan kami disandarkan pada standar global (GHG Protocol, ISO 14064), dan status ini kami nyatakan apa adanya.": "and an exchange simulation — not carbon credits tradable on a regulated market, and not a \"carbon neutral\" claim. Canopy cover index segmentation already runs as a module, but its values are still prototype sample data ⚠︎; routine satellite imagery intake, third-party certification, independent MRV, and registry recording are on the roadmap. Our calculations rest on global standards (GHG Protocol, ISO 14064), and we state this status exactly as it is.",
  "dan terbaca oleh tim Glyiv — bukan oleh pengguna lain. Yang tersimpan adalah isian formulir ini (nama, kontak, nama daerah, pengalaman) ditambah penanda area daftar pantauan bila Anda memilih salah satu. Tidak ada berkas, tidak ada koordinat, tidak ada nomor identitas — batas area yang Anda gambar tetap tertutup untuk tim Glyiv.": "and readable by the Glyiv team — not by other users. What is stored is this form (name, contact, area name, experience) plus a marker for the watchlist area if you pick one. No files, no coordinates, no identity numbers — the area boundary you draw stays closed to the Glyiv team.",
  "Dan yang tersisa setelah dipangkas — itu yang di-offset. Bukan sebaliknya.": "And what is left after the cutting — that is what gets offset. Not the other way round.",
  "Dana": "Funds",
