  "Dari tinggi, berat, usia, dan tingkat aktivitas, halaman ini memperkirakan kebutuhan energi harian Anda — lalu dari kebutuhan energi itu memperkirakan jejak karbon pola makan. Semua angkanya": "From your height, weight, age, and activity level, this page estimates your daily energy needs — then from those energy needs estimates the carbon footprint of your eating pattern. All of the figures",
  "Dari titik bayar, belanja, dan citra satelit untuk lahan (snapshot NDVI) — kelak juga perangkat IoT — aktivitas jadi data karbon. Merchant cukup mengisi resep: data yang memang sudah mereka punya untuk menghitung HPP.": "From the point of payment, from purchases, and from satellite imagery for land (an NDVI snapshot) — later from IoT devices too — activity becomes carbon data. A merchant only has to fill in the recipe: data they already keep to work out cost of goods.",
