  "dasbor menandai kiln & batch paling boros, lalu sisa emisi yang sulit dipangkas ditutup sebagai kontribusi lewat offset pohon tertokenisasi": "the dashboard flags the most wasteful kilns & batches, then the emissions that are hard to cut are covered as a contribution through tokenised tree offsets",
  "dasbor menandai titik boros energi, lalu sisa emisi yang belum bisa dipangkas ditutup sebagai kontribusi lewat offset pohon tertokenisasi — bukan klaim netral karbon": "the dashboard flags the energy-wasting points, then the emissions that cannot yet be cut are covered as a contribution through tokenised tree offsets — not a carbon neutral claim",
  "Dashboard ESG": "ESG Dashboard",
  "Dashboard inventarisasi daerah": "Regional inventory dashboard",
  "Dashboard menunggu Anda bertanya. Agen menemukan sendiri: ia membaca data karbon Anda tiap hari, menandai biaya yang bocor diam-diam, lalu menunjukkan cara menutupnya — keputusan tetap di tangan Anda.": "A dashboard waits for you to ask. An agent finds things itself: it reads your carbon data every day, flags the cost quietly leaking away, then shows how to close it — the decision stays yours.",
  "dashboard menyorot pemasok dan lini paling boros; baru setelah itu sisa emisi ditutup lewat kontribusi pohon tertokenisasi yang transparan": "the dashboard highlights the most wasteful suppliers and lines; only after that are the remaining emissions covered through a transparent tokenised tree contribution",
