  "data karbon primer di sumber — lewat merchant — data yang tak bisa dijangkau pesaing, lalu memonetisasinya berlapis.": "primary carbon data at the source — through merchants — data no competitor can reach, then monetize it in layers.",
  "Data karbon tanpa gesekan": "Carbon data without friction",
  "Data karbon tiap menu": "Carbon data for every menu item",
  "Data konsumsi dan pilahan diterjemahkan lewat metodologi activity-based LCA—aktivitas nyata dikalikan faktor emisi dari standar internasional (IPCC, DEFRA, ecoinvent), dengan fallback spend-based EEIO bila data mentah tidak lengkap. Lapisan agentic AI membaca pola pemakaian, menandai pemborosan, dan menyarankan penyetelan konkret. Penghematan dan sampah yang berhasil dipilah menjadi dasar kontribusi terlacak yang dapat diarahkan ke offset—bukan klaim netral karbon, melainkan kontribusi yang bisa dipertanggungjawabkan.": "Consumption and sorting data are translated through an activity-based LCA methodology—real activity multiplied by emission factors from international standards (IPCC, DEFRA, ecoinvent), with a spend-based EEIO fallback where raw data is incomplete. An agentic AI layer reads usage patterns, flags waste, and suggests concrete adjustments. The savings and the waste successfully sorted become the basis of a tracked contribution that can be directed toward offsets—not a carbon neutral claim, but a contribution that can be accounted for.",
  "Data lintas OPD dalam satu alur": "Data across agencies in one flow",
  "Data lokal": "Local data",
  "data lokal tidak pernah dihapus sebelum server mengonfirmasi": "local data is never deleted before the server confirms",
