  "Data prototipe: bukan lahan milik Glyiv, bukan lahan klien, dan batasnya bentuk perkiraan di sekitar titik pusat.": "Prototype data: not land owned by Glyiv, not client land, and its boundary is an approximate shape around the centre point.",
  "Data tercatat dikirim ke jaringan; kontribusi Anda jadi kredit hijau on-chain.": "Recorded data is sent to the network; your contribution becomes an on-chain green credit.",
  "data terlacak untuk dilampirkan ke dokumen tender dan negosiasi dengan kontraktor internasional — lembar data, bukan sertifikat": "tracked data to attach to tender documents and to negotiations with international contractors — a data sheet, not a certificate",
  "Data transaksi & resep yang sudah Anda isi otomatis menghasilkan jejak karbon per gerai — tanpa kerja tambahan, tanpa tim data.": "The transaction & recipe data you already fill in automatically produces a carbon footprint per outlet — no extra work, no data team.",
