  "Daur ulang & ekonomi sirkular warga": "Community recycling & circular economy",
  "Daur ulang & ekonomi sirkular warga.": "Community recycling & circular economy.",
  "DBH berarti diameter setinggi dada, yaitu 1,3 m dari permukaan tanah. Di lereng, ukur dari sisi atas lereng. Kalau batang bercabang di bawah 1,3 m, ukur tepat di bawah cabangnya dan tulis itu di catatan lapangan.": "DBH means diameter at breast height, that is 1.3 m above the ground surface. On a slope, take it from the uphill side. If the trunk forks below 1.3 m, take it just below the fork and write that in the field notes.",
  "DBH berarti diameter setinggi dada. Di lereng, diukur dari sisi atas lereng; kalau batang bercabang di bawahnya, ukur tepat di bawah cabang.": "DBH means diameter at breast height. On a slope, take it from the uphill side; if the trunk forks below that point, take it just below the fork.",
  "DBH pohon": "Tree DBH",
  "DBH, tinggi, spesies, estimasi CO₂e, catatan, waktu, dan koordinat — koordinat hanya bila Anda menekan tombol mengambilnya.": "DBH, height, species, estimated CO₂e, notes, time, and coordinates — coordinates only if you press the button that takes them.",
  "debug": "debug signature",
