  "Default ≈ 1.610 tCO2e/tahun (listrik 1.360 + gas 202 + diesel 50). Setara ~73.000 pohon/tahun (~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Dekarbonisasi listrik dulu (PPA/PLTS) — offset hanya menutup residual Scope 1 yang sulit dihindari.": "Default ≈ 1,610 tCO2e/year (electricity 1,360 + gas 202 + diesel 50). Equivalent to ~73,000 trees/year (~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Decarbonise electricity first (PPA/solar PV) — offsets only cover the hard-to-avoid Scope 1 residual.",
  "Default ≈ 2.020 tCO2e/tahun (truk-BBM 753 + jalan 950 + laut 320) ≈ ~92.000 pohon/tahun (~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Reduksi via modal shift & load factor dulu; offset menutup residual mil-terakhir yang belum bisa dielektrifikasi.": "Default ≈ 2,020 tCO2e/year (fuel trucks 753 + road 950 + sea 320) ≈ ~92,000 trees/year (~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Reduce first via modal shift & load factor; offsets cover the last-mile residual that cannot yet be electrified.",
  "Default ≈ 3.580 tCO2e/tahun (listrik 3.400 + genset 75 + refrigeran 104) ≈ ~163.000 pohon/tahun (~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Dekarbonisasi listrik (PPA renewable + PUE) adalah reduksi utama; offset hanya menutup residual Scope 1 (BBM genset & refrigeran) sebagai kontribusi, bukan klaim netral.": "Default ≈ 3,580 tCO2e/year (electricity 3,400 + generator 75 + refrigerants 104) ≈ ~163,000 trees/year (~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Decarbonising electricity (renewable PPA + PUE) is the main reduction; offsets only cover the residual Scope 1 (generator fuel & refrigerants) as a contribution, not a neutrality claim.",
  "Default ini ≈ 2.600 tCO2e (semen 1.180 + beton 870 + baja 555). Setara ~118.000 pohon/tahun (~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Reduksi via SCM & baja scrap-EAF dulu; offset (mis. reforestasi mangrove) menutup sisa sebagai kontribusi, bukan klaim carbon-neutral.": "This default is ≈ 2,600 tCO2e (cement 1,180 + concrete 870 + steel 555). Equivalent to ~118,000 trees/year (~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Reduce first via SCM & scrap-EAF steel; offsets (e.g. mangrove reforestation) cover the remainder as a contribution, not a carbon-neutral claim.",
  "Definisi PAL. ⚠︎ Tangga 1,2–1,9 di halaman ini adalah turunan populer, bukan kutipan langsung tabel PAL — lihat batasan di bawah.": "PAL definition. ⚠︎ The 1.2–1.9 ladder on this page is a popular derivation, not a direct quotation of the PAL table — see the limitations below.",
  "Dekati pohon ini": "Move closer to this tree",
  "Delapan dari sepuluh warga Indonesia menuntut aksi iklim yang lebih tegas, namun hampir separuh remaja masih berliterasi iklim rendah. Bahkan hanya separuh kurikulum nasional di dunia yang menyebut perubahan iklim, itu pun kerap berprioritas rendah. Niat baik sudah ada; peta jalan pengetahuannya yang hilang.": "Eight in ten Indonesians demand firmer climate action, yet nearly half of adolescents still have low climate literacy. Only half the world's national curricula even mention climate change, and often at low priority. The good intent is already there; what is missing is the knowledge roadmap.",
  "Delapan segitiga, satu arah.": "Eight triangles, one direction.",
