  "Dengan angka default (~30.389 tCO2e/tahun, didominasi financed emissions), offset penuh setara ~1,38 juta pohon/tahun (asumsi ~22 kg CO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Ini menegaskan offset tidak realistis untuk emisi terbiayai — postur jujur: prioritaskan pengurangan di portofolio, bukan klaim 'netral karbon'. Sebut 'kontribusi', bukan 'netral'.": "At the default figures (~30,389 tCO2e/year, dominated by financed emissions), offsetting the whole footprint would equal ~1.38 million trees/year (assuming ~22 kg CO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). This makes clear that offsetting is unrealistic for financed emissions — the honest posture: prioritise reduction in the portfolio, not a 'carbon neutral' claim. Say 'contribution', not 'neutral'.",
  "Dengan Glyiv": "With Glyiv",
