  "Di Android 7 dan yang lebih lama, saklarnya ada satu untuk seluruh ponsel:": "On Android 7 and older there is a single switch for the whole phone:",
  "Di Android/Chrome, menu peramban → “Tambahkan ke layar utama” membuatnya terbuka seperti aplikasi biasa dari layar utama. Salinan luringnya sama.": "On Android/Chrome, browser menu → “Add to Home screen” makes it open like an ordinary app from the home screen. The offline copy is the same.",
  "di arsip terkunci Glyiv, jadi angka pada foto itu tetap terbaca oleh tim peninjau — memang itu yang diperiksa. Fotonya hanya bisa dihapus admin Glyiv, tidak oleh Anda sendiri.": "in a locked Glyiv archive, so the numbers in that photo stay readable to the review team — that is exactly what is checked. The photo can only be deleted by a Glyiv admin, not by you.",
  "Di baliknya dirancang mesin karbon activity-based LCA yang sama dengan yang kami bangun untuk Glyiv GIP, ditopang agen AI yang mempersonalisasi materi dan sengaja menyorot aksi berdampak tinggi yang sering terlewat. Dari sana, progres belajar dapat disalurkan ke jalur kontribusi menuju proyek offset. Pengetahuan, keputusan, dan tindak lanjut berada di satu tempat.": "Behind it sits the same activity-based LCA carbon engine we built for Glyiv GIP, supported by an AI agent that personalises the material and deliberately highlights the high-impact actions people most often miss. From there, learning progress can be channelled into a contribution pathway toward offset projects. Knowledge, decision, and follow-through sit in one place.",
  "di bawah dan outlet Anda langsung hidup dengan masa uji coba": "below and your outlet goes live right away with a trial period of",
  "Di dalam Peta Aset Hijau": "Inside the Green Assets Map",
  "di genggaman.": "in your hands.",
  "di halaman ini adalah hitungan sungguhan atas bentuk yang Anda gambar — rumus luas poligon bola (spherical excess, Chamberlain & Duquette, NASA JPL) dengan jari-jari Bumi yang sama dengan seluruh sistem Glyiv, bukan rumus bidang datar.": "on this page are real computations over the shape you draw — the spherical polygon area formula (spherical excess, Chamberlain & Duquette, NASA JPL) with the same Earth radius used across the whole Glyiv system, not a flat-plane formula.",
  "Di Indonesia unit karbon = efek. Arsitektur patuh yang dibangun sejak awal jadi keunggulan sulit ditiru.": "In Indonesia, carbon units = securities. A compliant architecture built from day one becomes an edge that's hard to copy.",
  "di kartunya masing-masing.": "on its own card.",
  "Di keranjang, konsumen dapat menambahkan langkah offset ke proyek terpilih; kontribusi tercatat transparan dan berbalas imbalan yang bisa ditukar dalam ekosistem Glyiv.": "In the cart, shoppers can add an offset step towards a selected project; the contribution is recorded transparently and returns a reward that can be redeemed within the Glyiv ecosystem.",
  "di lapangan, tidak pernah terlacak sebagai biaya karbon maupun biaya Rupiah": "in the field, never tracked as a carbon cost or as a Rupiah cost",
  "di lapangan.": "in the field.",
  "Di layar itu, nyalakan": "On that screen, turn on",
  "Di logistik, karbon dan biaya adalah dua sisi mata uang yang sama: hampir setiap kilogram CO2 berasal dari solar yang Anda beli. Melacak emisi per kendaraan, per rute, dan per pengiriman langsung menelanjangi pemborosan yang selama ini tenggelam dalam tagihan bahan bakar gabungan — mesin idle berjam-jam, rute memutar, muatan kosong pada perjalanan balik, dan ban/perawatan buruk yang menambah konsumsi. Selain itu, pelanggan korporat besar kini menuntut data emisi Scope 3 dari vendor logistiknya; yang tak bisa menyediakannya kehilangan kontrak. Karbon yang terlacak menunjukkan solar yang bisa dihemat — sekaligus data yang diminta klien korporat.": "In logistics, carbon and cost are two sides of the same coin: almost every kilogram of CO2 comes from diesel you paid for. Tracking emissions per vehicle, per route, and per delivery lays bare the waste that has long disappeared into a combined fuel bill — engines idling for hours, detours, empty loads on the return leg, and poor tyres/maintenance that push consumption up. On top of that, large corporate customers now demand Scope 3 emissions data from their logistics vendors; those who cannot supply it lose contracts. Tracked carbon shows the diesel that could be saved — and, at the same time, the data corporate clients are asking for.",
  "di mana": "where",
  "Di mana data disimpan, dan berapa lama": "Where data is stored, and for how long",
  "Di mana disimpan & berapa lama": "Where it is stored & for how long",
  "di mana material berkarbon tinggi paling banyak dipakai": "where high-carbon materials are used the most",
  "Di marketplace hari ini konsumen tahu persis berapa rupiah yang dibayar, tapi tak pernah tahu berapa emisi yang menyertai. Padahal konsumsi rumah tangga menyumbang sekitar 72% emisi gas rumah kaca global. Keputusan belanja diambil setiap detik tanpa satu pun sinyal iklim.": "In today's marketplaces a consumer knows exactly how many rupiah were paid, but never how much emission came with it. Yet household consumption accounts for about 72% of global greenhouse gas emissions. Purchase decisions are made every second without a single climate signal.",
  "Di pasar karbon biasa, Anda membeli janji: selembar sertifikat, dan tidak ada cara memeriksa apakah pohonnya masih berdiri tahun depan.": "In an ordinary carbon market you buy a promise: a sheet of certificate, and no way to check whether the tree is still standing next year.",
  "Di perangkat Anda saja:": "On your device only:",
  "Di ritel & F&B, jejak karbon per outlet adalah cermin efisiensi biaya yang jujur. Melacaknya menyoroti pemborosan yang tenggelam dalam tagihan gabungan: pendingin & AC yang menyala boros di jam sepi, freezer yang bocor dinginnya, dan — yang paling menyakitkan margin — bahan baku yang basi lalu terbuang. Indonesia termasuk penghasil sampah makanan terbesar; setiap kilogram bahan yang dibuang adalah uang yang dibayar dua kali: biaya beli, lalu biaya buang. Bandingkan intensitas karbon antar outlet, dan pemilik langsung melihat mana yang bocor — cukup awal untuk menutupnya.": "In retail & F&B, the carbon footprint per outlet is an honest mirror of cost efficiency. Tracking it highlights the waste that disappears into a combined bill: chillers & air conditioning running wastefully during quiet hours, freezers leaking their cold, and — most painful of all for margins — raw material that spoils and is thrown away. Indonesia is among the largest producers of food waste; every kilogram of material discarded is money paid twice: the cost of buying it, then the cost of disposing of it. Compare carbon intensity across outlets, and the owner sees straight away which one is leaking — early enough to close it.",
  "Di server Glyiv (akun Anda):": "On the Glyiv server (your account):",
  "di setiap kredit yang disalurkan": "in every loan disbursed",
  "di sumbernya": "at the source",
  "di tab lain — pesananmu muncul di sana secara langsung.": "in another tab — your order shows up there live.",
  "di tab lain — pesanannya muncul di papan ini.": "in another tab — its orders appear on this board.",
  "Di titik bayar, pembeli bisa menambahkan tebusan kecil yang mengalir ke proyek terpilih, atau mengaitkannya ke pohon di Glyiv Aset. Setiap kontribusi tercatat transparan dan berbalas imbalan yang bisa ditukar di ekosistem Glyiv — hidup hijau, imbalan nyata. Sertifikasi pihak ketiga masih dalam roadmap, dan kami menyatakannya terbuka.": "At the point of payment, a buyer can add a small redemption that flows to a selected project, or link it to a tree in Glyiv Green Assets. Every contribution is recorded transparently and returns a reward redeemable across the Glyiv ecosystem — live green, real reward. Third-party certification is still on the roadmap, and we say so openly.",
  "Di-scan": "Scanned",
  "diam-diam menggerus laba.": "quietly eroding your margin.",
