  "EU CBAM masuk fase definitif — kewajiban emisi impor mulai berjalan: besi, baja, aluminium, semen, pupuk.": "EU CBAM enters its definitive phase — import emission obligations begin: iron, steel, aluminium, cement, fertiliser.",
