  "European Commission, sweep gabungan otoritas perlindungan konsumen atas klaim hijau daring (2020/2021)": "European Commission, joint consumer-protection sweep of online green claims (2020/2021)",
  "Event & aktivitas go green": "Events & green activities",
  "F&B & Ritel": "F&B & Retail",
  "F&B & ritel · titik bayar": "F&B & retail · point of payment",
  "F&B & ritel berdata karbon": "F&B & retail with carbon data",
  "F&B dan ritel adalah wajah ekonomi keseharian Indonesia — ribuan gerai, jutaan transaksi, margin yang tipis dan berharga. Justru karena marginnya ketat, setiap kebocoran kecil di listrik, gas, dan bahan baku yang terbuang langsung terasa di laba. Di sinilah Glyiv memulai, dan inilah satu-satunya vertikal kami yang sudah berjalan di lapangan: sistem operasi outlet bukan lagi sekadar alat transaksi, tapi juga alat pelacak jejak karbon per outlet. Karbon yang terlacak per outlet membuka mata pemilik pada biaya yang selama ini tenggelam di laporan bulanan gabungan — sekaligus menyiapkan brand untuk pembeli korporat yang mulai menagih data keberlanjutan pemasoknya.": "F&B and retail are the face of Indonesia's everyday economy — thousands of outlets, millions of transactions, margins that are thin and precious. Precisely because those margins are tight, every small leak in electricity, gas, and wasted raw material lands straight on profit. This is where Glyiv began, and it is our only vertical already running in the field: the outlet operating system is no longer merely a transaction tool, but also a tracker of the carbon footprint per outlet. Carbon tracked per outlet opens the owner's eyes to costs long buried in a combined monthly report — and at the same time prepares the brand for corporate buyers who are starting to demand sustainability data from their suppliers.",
  "Faktor aktivitas (PAL) 1,2–1,9.": "Activity factor (PAL) 1.2–1.9.",
  "Faktor aktivitas 1,2–1,9 dari FAO/WHO/UNU mengubah BMR jadi kebutuhan kalori harian.": "Activity factors of 1.2–1.9 from FAO/WHO/UNU turn BMR into daily calorie needs.",
  "Faktor berbasis belanja (EXIOBASE, kgCO₂e/Rp). Cakupan terluas untuk memulai cepat.": "Spend-based emission factors (EXIOBASE, kgCO₂e/Rp). Widest coverage to get started fast.",
  "Faktor emisi kami yang kelola. Mesin kami membaca struk dan menghitung jejaknya — lengkap dengan tier data dan rentang ketidakpastiannya. Agen yang menandai pemborosan dan menyarankan aksi masih dikembangkan.": "The emission factors are ours to maintain. Our engine reads the receipt and computes the footprint — complete with data tier and uncertainty range. The agent that flags waste and suggests action is still in development.",
  "Faktor emisi pangan; dampak bisa beda ~50× antar produsen → wajib berentang.": "Food emission factors; impact can differ ~50× between producers → a range is mandatory.",
  "faktor, dan setiap angkanya menyebutkan sumbernya sendiri (Poore & Nemecek 2018, ADEME Agribalyse 3.1, daftar per sistem Ditjen Ketenagalistrikan ESDM, Defra/DESNZ, dan lainnya). Sebagian di antaranya proksi atau nilai turunan — tiap kartu hasil menyebutkannya sendiri.": "factors, and every figure states its own source (Poore & Nemecek 2018, ADEME Agribalyse 3.1, the per-system list from the ESDM Directorate General of Electricity, Defra/DESNZ, and others). Some of them are proxies or derived values — each result card says so itself.",
