  "Foto item, tahu karbonnya. Agen AI Glyiv mengestimasi jejaknya secara berjenjang dan bersumber, lalu": "Photograph an item, know its carbon. The Glyiv AI agent estimates its footprint in tiers and with sources, then",
  "Foto Komisaris bersifat sementara (placeholder) hingga foto resmi tersedia.": "The Commissioner's photo is temporary (a placeholder) until the official photo is available.",
