  "Foto tetap di perangkat": "Photos stay on the device",
  "Foto tetap di perangkat Anda. Yang diunggah ke server Glyiv hanya angkanya (DBH, tinggi, spesies, estimasi CO₂e, dan koordinat bila Anda mengizinkannya) — bukan fotonya. Foto lapangan sering memuat orang, plang, dan lokasi persis, jadi ia tidak kami kirim ke mana pun.": "Photos stay on your device. Only the numbers are uploaded to the Glyiv server (DBH, height, species, estimated CO₂e, and coordinates if you allow it) — never the photo. Field photos often contain people, signs, and exact locations, so we do not send them anywhere.",
