  "Gaya hidup": "Lifestyle",
  "gedung pemda, penerangan jalan umum, dan armada dinas dibaca sebagai satu pos — pemborosan APBD yang berulang tiap tahun": "regional government buildings, street lighting, and official fleets are read as a single line item — a regional budget drain that repeats every year",
  "Gelombang awal": "First wave",
  "Gelombang pertama perangkat karbon sibuk menghitung emisi. Gelombang berikutnya — agen AI — membaca data itu terhadap biaya, menemukan pemborosan yang tak disadari, lalu menutupnya.": "The first wave of carbon tools was busy counting emissions. The next wave — AI agents — reads that data against cost, finds the waste nobody noticed, then closes it.",
