  "Glyiv Dana": "Glyiv Funds",
  "Glyiv dapat menangguhkan outlet yang tagihannya menunggak atau yang masa cobanya sudah lewat. Selama ditangguhkan, pesanan BARU ditolak sistem, sementara seluruh data lama tetap bisa Anda baca dan unduh. Outlet aktif kembali setelah tagihan diselesaikan.": "Glyiv may suspend an outlet whose invoice is overdue or whose trial has passed. While suspended, NEW orders are refused by the system, while all older data stays readable and downloadable by you. The outlet becomes active again once the invoice is settled.",
  "Glyiv dibangun Indonesia-first — lalu dijembatani ke standar & pasar internasional. Struktur tim 2+2 adalah strategi, bukan kebetulan: tim produk membangunnya, tim Eropa menghubungkannya ke dunia.": "Glyiv is built Indonesia-first — then bridged to international standards & markets. The 2+2 team structure is strategy, not coincidence: the product team builds it, the European team connects it to the world.",
  "Glyiv Dompet": "Glyiv Pocket",
  "Glyiv GIP Outlet mencatat transaksi harian outlet Anda dan menghitung jejak karbon tiap menu dari resepnya — terlacak sampai ke bahannya, dan asal setiap angka selalu disebutkan.": "Glyiv GIP Outlet records your outlet's daily transactions and works out the carbon footprint of every menu item from its recipe — tracked down to the ingredient, with the source of every number always stated.",
  "Glyiv Green Assets · alat lapangan": "Glyiv Green Assets · field tool",
  "Glyiv Lab adalah arah jangka panjang. Kami tidak mengklaim sudah punya \"plastik ajaib\" hari ini — kami menyatakannya apa adanya: riset berbasis LCA, kolaborasi terbuka, dan hasil yang dilaporkan apa adanya. Sertifikasi & skala industri ada dalam roadmap.": "Glyiv Lab is a long-term direction. We do not claim to have a \"miracle plastic\" today — we state it as it is: LCA-based research, open collaboration, and results reported as they are. Certification & industrial scale are on the roadmap.",
  "Glyiv Lab menyerang lapisan yang jarang disentuh:": "Glyiv Lab goes after the layer that is rarely touched:",
  "Glyiv membalik urutannya.": "Glyiv reverses the order.",
  "Glyiv membuatnya terlihat — tanpa menambah pekerjaan siapa pun.": "Glyiv makes it visible — without adding work for anyone.",
  "Glyiv memetakan financed emissions per sektor": "Glyiv maps financed emissions by sector",
  "Glyiv memetakan Scope 1 & 2 per lini dan per ton logam": "Glyiv maps Scope 1 & 2 per line and per tonne of metal",
  "Glyiv menghitung emisi portofolio": "Glyiv computes portfolio emissions",
  "Glyiv menghitung karbon terembodi per ton semen dan per proyek": "Glyiv works out the embodied carbon per tonne of cement and per project",
  "Glyiv mengubah aktivitas harianmu — belanja, bepergian, membuang sampah — jadi": "Glyiv turns your daily activities — shopping, travelling, throwing out waste — into",
  "Glyiv mengubah tiap transaksi menjadi": "Glyiv turns every transaction into",
  "Glyiv menyebutnya \"kontribusi\", bukan klaim \"karbon netral\". Setiap rupiah dilaporkan terbuka dan dapat diaudit — sesuai praktik integritas (VCMI/ICVCM) dan UU PDP.": "Glyiv calls it a “contribution,” not a “carbon neutral” claim. Every rupiah is reported openly and auditably — aligned with integrity frameworks (VCMI/ICVCM) and UU PDP.",
  "Glyiv menyebutnya “kontribusi”, bukan klaim “karbon netral”. Setiap rupiah dilaporkan terbuka dan dapat diaudit — sesuai praktik integritas (VCMI/ICVCM) dan UU PDP.": "Glyiv calls it a “contribution”, not a “carbon neutral” claim. Every rupiah is reported openly and can be audited — in line with integrity practice (VCMI/ICVCM) and the Personal Data Protection Law.",
  "Glyiv Outlet": "Glyiv Outlet",
  "Glyiv Outlet · F&B & Ritel": "Glyiv Outlet · F&B & Retail",
  "Glyiv Outlet · POS berdata karbon": "Glyiv Outlet · carbon-data POS",
  "Glyiv Pangan": "Glyiv Food",
  "Glyiv Pasar": "Glyiv Market",
  "Glyiv Pocket": "Glyiv Pocket",
  "Glyiv Pocket · aplikasi konsumen": "Glyiv Pocket · consumer app",
  "Glyiv Pocket adalah pintu masuk perorangan ke ekosistem Glyiv, dan ia muat di satu layar ponsel. Satu istilah perlu diluruskan lebih dulu — aplikasinya sendiri menuliskannya di layar:": "Glyiv Pocket is the individual's way into the Glyiv ecosystem, and it fits on a single phone screen. One term needs to be set straight first — the app itself writes it on screen:",
  "Glyiv Pocket bukan pratinjau": "Glyiv Pocket is not a preview",
  "Glyiv Scan Karbon": "Glyiv Carbon Scan",
  "Glyiv Sehat": "Glyiv Health",
  "Glyiv tidak menerima uang Anda dan tidak bisa memeriksa pembayaran. Pembayaran diperiksa sendiri oleh outlet.": "Glyiv does not receive your money and cannot check payments. Payments are checked by the outlet itself.",
  "Glyiv tidak menjual kredit karbon": "Glyiv does not sell carbon credits",
  "Glyiv tumbuh dari orang-orang yang mau hidup lebih hijau tanpa ribet. Dari mahasiswa sampai pemilik outlet kecil — semua punya tempat, punya peran, dan punya imbalan. Tidak perlu jadi ahli iklim untuk ikut.": "Glyiv grows out of people who want to live greener without the fuss. From students to small outlet owners — everyone has a place, a role, and a reward. You do not have to be a climate expert to take part.",
  "Glyiv-Green-Assets.apk · 20,7 KB": "Glyiv-Green-Assets.apk · 20.7 KB",
  "Glyiv-Outlet.apk · 16,5 KB": "Glyiv-Outlet.apk · 16.5 KB",
