  "Hub dirancang mencatat karbon di tiap simpul rantai: bahan saat kulakan atau panen, energi saat diproses, material saat dikemas, dan jarak saat didistribusikan. Karena datanya lahir di sumber — bukan tebakan kategori — angka di label bisa dipertanggungjawabkan, dan penjual bisa melihat persis di mana jejaknya bisa dipangkas.": "The Hub is designed to record carbon at every node of the chain: ingredients at purchase or harvest, energy during processing, material at packaging, and distance at distribution. Because the data is born at the source — not a category-level guess — the number on the label can be defended, and the seller can see exactly where the footprint can be trimmed.",
  "Hub pangan berdata karbon": "Food hub with carbon data",
  "Hub pangan berdata karbon: dari kulakan atau panen sampai siap jual, tiap produk berlabel kalori, emisi, dan nilai untuk menebusnya. Contoh langsung 'show, don't tell' dari misi Glyiv.": "A carbon-data food hub: from wholesale or harvest through to ready for sale, every product is labelled with its calories, emissions, and the value needed to redeem them. A direct 'show, don't tell' example of the Glyiv mission.",
