  "IDXCarbon (rujukan pasar)": "IDXCarbon (market reference)",
  "IDXCarbon dibuka 26 September 2023 dengan lonceng dan optimisme; dua tahun kemudian sekitar 1,6 juta ton CO2e tercatat berpindah tangan — angka nyata, tapi sebagian besar terjadi hanya dalam hitungan hari, dan likuiditas hariannya masih tipis.": "IDXCarbon opened on 26 September 2023 with a bell and optimism; two years on, about 1.6 million tonnes CO2e are on record as having changed hands — a real figure, but most of it happened within a matter of days, and daily liquidity is still thin.",
  "IFRS S2 mulai berlaku, mewajibkan pengungkapan emisi Scope 3 Kategori 15 (financed/portfolio emissions) termasuk emisi atas aset yang dikelola": "IFRS S2 takes effect, requiring disclosure of Scope 3 Category 15 emissions (financed/portfolio emissions), including emissions from assets under management",
