  "Imbalan dan kontribusi karbon disalurkan ke penanaman lanjutan, retensi tegakan, atau retirement kredit karbon — disertai laporan dampak berkala yang menunjukkan hasil per rupiah, bukan klaim netralitas.": "Rewards and carbon contributions are channelled into further planting, stand retention, or the retirement of carbon credits — with a periodic impact report showing results per rupiah, not a neutrality claim.",
