  "Individu · per item": "Individual · per item",
  "Individu & per-item": "Individual & per-item",
  "Indonesia · beroperasi global": "Indonesia · operating globally",
  "Indonesia berkomitmen menurunkan emisi 31,89% (tanpa syarat) hingga 43,20% (dengan dukungan internasional) pada 2030, dan menyiapkan NDC Kedua sebagai kelanjutannya menjelang COP30. Sektor energi dan tata guna lahan menyumbang lebih dari 60% target itu. Namun komitmen nasional baru bermakna ketika diterjemahkan menjadi inventarisasi emisi daerah yang bisa ditelusuri dan diaudit. Di situlah akuntansi karbon menjadi fondasi: syarat masuk ke pembiayaan iklim internasional, ke mekanisme Pasal 6 Perjanjian Paris, dan ke result-based payment — mengubah target iklim menjadi arus pendapatan dan investasi pembangunan. Rancangan modul inilah yang sedang kami bangun.": "Indonesia is committed to cutting emissions by 31.89% (unconditional) up to 43.20% (with international support) by 2030, and is preparing a Second NDC as the follow-up ahead of COP30. The energy and land use sectors account for more than 60% of that target. But a national commitment only means something once it is translated into regional emissions inventories that can be traced and audited. That is where carbon accounting becomes the foundation: the entry requirement for international climate finance, for the Article 6 mechanism of the Paris Agreement, and for result-based payment — turning climate targets into streams of revenue and development investment. This is the module design we are building.",
  "Indonesia berkomitmen menurunkan emisi 31,89% (tanpa syarat) hingga 43,20% (dengan dukungan internasional) pada 2030, dan menyiapkan NDC Kedua sebagai kelanjutannya. ⚠︎ Halaman ini memaparkan": "Indonesia has committed to cutting emissions by 31.89% (unconditional) up to 43.20% (with international support) by 2030, and is preparing a Second NDC as the follow-up. ⚠︎ This page sets out",
  "Indonesia dulu, siap global": "Indonesia first, built for global",
  "Indonesia memproduksi sekitar 69,9 juta ton sampah pada 2023, dan sebagian besar berakhir di TPA terbuka yang melepas metana. Di sisi lain, seluruh jaringan bank sampah nasional baru mampu menangani 0,34% dari timbulan itu. Bukan karena warga tak peduli, melainkan karena memilah terasa merepotkan dan imbalannya tak pernah terlihat nyata.": "Indonesia generated about 69.9 million tonnes of waste in 2023, and most of it ended up in open landfills that release methane. Meanwhile, the entire national waste bank network can handle only 0.34% of that volume. Not because people do not care, but because sorting feels like a hassle and the reward never looks real.",
  "Indonesia: POJK No. 51/POJK.03/2017 mewajibkan Lembaga Jasa Keuangan menerapkan Keuangan Berkelanjutan dan menerbitkan Laporan Keberlanjutan (publikasi paling lambat 30 April); Taksonomi untuk Keuangan Berkelanjutan Indonesia (TKBI) menjadi acuan klasifikasi aktivitas hijau; OJK sedang menyelaraskan POJK 51 dengan standar internasional ISSB IFRS S1 & S2. Global: standar PCAF (Partnership for Carbon Accounting Financials) menjadi metodologi de-facto untuk mengukur financed emissions, dan IFRS S2 mewajibkan pengungkapan emisi Scope 3 Kategori 15 (financed emissions). Glyiv menyelaraskan metodologinya dengan standar global (GHG Protocol/ISO 14064) — detail teknis dirinci dalam whitepaper rahasia kami.": "Indonesia: POJK No. 51/POJK.03/2017 requires Financial Services Institutions to apply Sustainable Finance and publish a Sustainability Report (published by 30 April at the latest); the Indonesian Sustainable Finance Taxonomy (TKBI) serves as the reference for classifying green activities; OJK is aligning POJK 51 with the international ISSB IFRS S1 & S2 standards. Global: the PCAF (Partnership for Carbon Accounting Financials) standard has become the de-facto methodology for measuring financed emissions, and IFRS S2 requires disclosure of Scope 3 Category 15 emissions (financed emissions). Glyiv aligns its methodology with global standards (GHG Protocol/ISO 14064) — the technical detail is set out in our confidential whitepaper.",
  "Induk perusahaan": "Parent company",
  "Industri Berat": "Heavy Industry",
  "Infra Data, E-Wallet, Tree RWA & DPI": "Data Infrastructure, E-Wallet, Tree RWA & DPI",
