  "Integritas & token": "Integrity & token",
  "Integritas data": "Data integrity",
  "Integritas dulu: perhitungan selaras GHG Protocol (spend-based→item-based), aset karbon mengikuti disiplin MRV & registri. Tokenisasi hanya lapisan utilitas/loyalitas — bukan mengaku sebagai unit karbon teregulasi.": "Integrity first: calculations align with the GHG Protocol (spend-based→item-based); carbon assets follow MRV & registry discipline. Tokenization is only a utility/loyalty layer — never claiming to be a regulated carbon unit.",
  "Integritas dulu.": "Integrity first.",
  "Intelijen karbon bukan hanya untuk korporasi. Hitung jejakmu dari gaya hidup (IMT/diet), atau": "Carbon intelligence is not only for corporations. Calculate your footprint from lifestyle (BMI/diet), or",
  "Intelijen karbon yang jujur": "Honest carbon intelligence",
  "intensitas karbon": "carbon intensity",
  "Intensitas karbon per kWh": "Carbon intensity per kWh",
  "Intensitas karbon per outlet · ilustrasi, angka contoh": "Carbon intensity per outlet · illustrative, sample figures",
  "Intensitas karbon tinggi menyembunyikan uang yang bocor tiap hari. Tungku RKEF berbahan batu bara rata-rata melepas sekitar 45 ton CO2 per ton nikel, lebih dari tiga kali lipat jalur pengolahan MHP/HPAL, dan setiap ton CO2 berlebih itu adalah bahan bakar yang terbeli namun terbuang, bukan logam yang terjual. Ketika karbon dipetakan per lini, per tungku, dan per shift, terlihat di mana energi hangus percuma, di mana idle-load menyala tanpa produksi, dan di mana pembeli mulai menahan premium. Selisih intensitas inilah yang menentukan apakah Anda dibeli dengan harga penuh atau didiskon sebagai 'high-carbon supply'.": "High carbon intensity hides money that leaks away every day. Coal-fired RKEF furnaces release on average around 45 tonnes of CO2 per tonne of nickel, more than three times the MHP/HPAL processing route, and every excess tonne of CO2 is fuel that was bought and then wasted, not metal that was sold. Once carbon is mapped per line, per furnace, and per shift, you can see where energy burns away for nothing, where idle load runs with no production, and where buyers are starting to hold back the premium. It is this difference in intensity that decides whether you are bought at full price or discounted as 'high-carbon supply'.",
  "Intensitas per 1.000 kkal belum ada di pustaka faktor emisi Glyiv.": "Intensity per 1,000 kcal is not yet in the Glyiv emission factor library.",
  "Inti · Green Membership": "Core · Green Membership",
