  "juga perhitungan sungguhan atas luas itu, tetapi ia selalu rentang: parameter serapannya belum dikalibrasi lapangan, dan nilai NDVI dimasukkan manual, bukan ditarik dari citra satelit. Angkanya": "is also a real computation over that area, but always a range: its absorption parameters are not field-calibrated, and the NDVI value is entered by hand, not pulled from satellite imagery. The figure is",
