  "Kalau hijau hanya jadi biaya, tidak ada yang bertahan lama. Karena itu infrastruktur Glyiv dirancang agar pemilik outlet, pemilik lahan, dan orang biasa bisa menerima": "If green is only ever a cost, nothing lasts long. That is why Glyiv's infrastructure is designed so that outlet owners, landowners, and ordinary people can receive",
