  "Kalori, emisi terlacak, dan nilai tebus tampil di kemasan dan struk — sinyal iklim tepat di titik keputusan, tanpa klaim netral yang berlebihan.": "Calories, tracked emissions, and redemption value appear on the packaging and the receipt — a climate signal right at the point of decision, with no overstated neutrality claim.",
  "Kalori, emisi, dan cara menebus — dalam satu label.": "Calories, emissions, and how to redeem — on one label.",
  "kalori, emisi, dan cara menebusnya": "calories, emissions, and how to redeem them",
