  "Kanal media sosial Glyiv sedang disiapkan — kami tidak menautkannya sebelum benar-benar aktif. Sementara ini, Kabar dan email adalah kanal resmi kami.": "Glyiv's social media channels are being prepared — we do not link to them before they are genuinely active. For now, Kabar and email are our official channels.",
