  "Kemasan makanan hari ini rapi mencantumkan harga dan kalori, tapi hampir tak pernah dampak iklimnya. Padahal sistem pangan menyumbang sekitar seperempat emisi gas rumah kaca global, dan pilihan di piring — nabati atau daging, lokal atau impor — bisa berbeda berkali-kali lipat. Sinyal itu hilang tepat saat keputusan dibuat.": "Food packaging today lists price and calories neatly, but almost never the climate impact. Yet food systems account for about a quarter of global greenhouse gas emissions, and the choice on the plate — plant or meat, local or imported — can differ many times over. That signal goes missing at the exact moment the decision is made.",
