  "ketik": "type",
  "Ketik nama barang dan jumlahnya. Saku mencocokkannya ke pustaka faktor emisi, lalu menampilkan rentang CO₂e beserta tier data dan sumbernya. Belum ada yang cocok? Ia mengatakannya terus terang, bukan menebak.": "Type the item name and its quantity. Saku matches it against the emission factor library, then shows the CO₂e range along with the data tier and its source. Nothing matches yet? It says so plainly, instead of guessing.",
  "Ketik nama satu barang — kopi, telur, nasi — lalu Glyiv mencarinya di pustaka faktor emisi dan menghitung estimasinya, tanpa akun dan tanpa mendaftar. (“Pindai” di Glyiv berarti mencari di pustaka; pengenalan barang lewat kamera masih peta jalan, belum ada.) Akun baru diperlukan kalau Anda ingin catatan hariannya": "Type the name of one item — coffee, egg, rice — and Glyiv looks it up in the emission factor library and computes the estimate, with no account and no sign-up. (“Scan” in Glyiv means searching the library; recognising an item through the camera is still roadmap, not yet available.) An account is only needed if you want the daily log",
  "Ketik nama satu barang — kopi, telur, nasi — lalu Glyiv mencarinya di pustaka faktor emisi dan menghitung estimasinya, tanpa akun dan tanpa mendaftar. (“Pindai” di Glyiv berarti mencari di pustaka; pengenalan barang lewat kamera masih peta jalan, belum ada.) Akun baru diperlukan kalau Anda ingin catatan hariannya tersimpan dan bisa dibuka lagi besok.": "Type one item name — coffee, eggs, rice — and Glyiv looks it up in the emission factor library and works out an estimate, with no account and no sign-up. (“Scan” in Glyiv means a library lookup; recognising items through the camera is still on the roadmap, not built.) An account is only needed if you want the daily notes saved and reopenable tomorrow.",
  "Ketuk berkasnya. Android menolak dan menawarkan tombol menuju": "Tap the file. Android refuses and offers a button leading to",
  "Ketuk peta untuk menaruh": "Tap the map to place",
  "Ketuk peta untuk menaruh titik batas sebuah area — kebun, petak mangrove, halaman sekolah. Bentuknya": "Tap the map to drop boundary points for an area — a garden, a mangrove plot, a schoolyard. The shape is",
  "Ketuk sebuah menu. Label memperlihatkan kalori, emisi karbon beserta rinciannya per simpul rantai, dan nilai untuk menebusnya. Angka ilustrasi ⚠︎ — faktor emisi bersumber Poore & Nemecek (2018) & ADEME Agribalyse.": "Tap an item. The label shows calories, carbon emissions broken down per node of the chain, and the value to redeem them. Illustrative figures ⚠︎ — emission factors sourced from Poore & Nemecek (2018) & ADEME Agribalyse.",
