  "Khairul bergabung sebagai Co-Founder — mempertajam strategi, inovasi, dan daya saing. Bersama, mereka mengubah keyakinan itu menjadi produk nyata: POS yang dipakai karena untung, dengan data karbon level-item yang lahir sendiri tiap transaksi.": "Khairul joined as Co-Founder — sharpening strategy, innovation, and competitiveness. Together they turned that conviction into a real product: a POS used because it pays, with item-level carbon data born of every transaction.",
  "kilometer yang dibayar penuh tapi menghasilkan setengah": "kilometres paid for in full but delivering half",
  "Kini Glyiv memakai citra pihak ketiga (snapshot NDVI Sentinel‑2) sebagai indikasi tutupan. Monitoring langsung near-real-time (deteksi perubahan, verifikasi otomatis) masih roadmap — Glyiv": "Today Glyiv uses third-party imagery (Sentinel‑2 NDVI snapshots) as an indication of canopy cover. Direct near-real-time monitoring (change detection, automatic verification) is still roadmap — Glyiv",
