  "Konsumen awam dan investor enterprise membeli hal berbeda dari produk yang sama. Kami memelihara dua lapis pesan di atas satu tulang punggung data yang sama.": "Everyday consumers and enterprise investors buy different things from the same product. We keep two layers of messaging on top of one and the same data backbone.",
  "konsumen Indonesia bersedia membayar lebih untuk produk berkelanjutan.": "of Indonesian consumers are willing to pay more for sustainable products.",
  "konsumsi bahan bakar kiln, rasio klinker, listrik, dan bill of material proyek — melalui onboarding Glyiv yang dipandu langkah demi langkah": "kiln fuel consumption, clinker ratio, electricity, and the project bill of materials — through Glyiv onboarding guided step by step",
  "Konsumsi bahan bakar membengkak": "Fuel consumption ballooning",
  "konsumsi bahan bakar, listrik captive, throughput per tungku — lewat onboarding terpandu Glyiv, tanpa perlu tim data internal": "fuel consumption, captive power, throughput per furnace — through Glyiv's guided onboarding, with no internal data team needed",
  "Konsumsi energi · 12 jam terakhir (kWh)": "Energy use · last 12 hours (kWh)",
  "Konsumsi listrik pusat data global diproyeksikan berlipat ganda menjadi sekitar 945 TWh pada 2030 — setara total permintaan listrik Jepang, atau hampir 3% listrik dunia — didorong ledakan AI. Di Asia Tenggara termasuk Indonesia, batu bara masih menjadi tulang punggung pasokan listriknya, sehingga intensitas karbon per kWh di sini termasuk tinggi. Bagi operator, akuntansi karbon kini jadi bahasa yang diminta pelanggan enterprise global: mereka membeli 'cloud rendah karbon' dan menagih angka emisi yang bisa ditelusuri sebelum tanda tangan kontrak. Tanpa angka yang kredibel, Anda berisiko gugur di tahap prakualifikasi. Rancangan modul inilah yang sedang kami bangun.": "Global data centre electricity consumption is projected to double to around 945 TWh by 2030 — equivalent to Japan's total electricity demand, or almost 3% of the world's electricity — driven by the AI boom. In Southeast Asia, Indonesia included, coal is still the backbone of the power supply, so carbon intensity per kWh here is among the high ones. For operators, carbon accounting has become the language global enterprise customers ask for: they buy 'low-carbon cloud' and demand traceable emissions figures before signing a contract. Without credible figures, you risk being dropped at pre-qualification. This is the module design we are building.",
  "Konsumsi listrik pusat data global diproyeksikan berlipat ganda menjadi sekitar 945 TWh pada 2030, setara total permintaan listrik Jepang. ⚠︎ Halaman ini memaparkan": "Global data centre electricity consumption is projected to double to about 945 TWh by 2030, equivalent to Japan's total electricity demand. ⚠︎ This page sets out",
