  "Kontribusi teragregasi menjadi laporan komunitas kampus yang transparan; sisa jejak yang tak dapat dihindari bisa diimbangi melalui proyek offset terpilih — dengan sertifikasi pihak ketiga sebagai bagian dari roadmap.": "Contributions aggregate into a transparent campus community report; the unavoidable remainder of the footprint can be balanced through selected offset projects — with third-party certification as part of the roadmap.",
  "kontribusi terlacak": "tracked contribution",
  "Kontribusi terlacak tercatat rapi lalu masuk laporan karbon Anda; rekonsiliasi ke registri resmi masih peta jalan ⚠︎.": "The tracked contribution is recorded cleanly and then enters your carbon report; reconciliation to an official registry is still roadmap ⚠︎.",
  "kontribusi transparan": "transparent contributions",
