  "Kuis literasi dan game menerjemahkan konsep menjadi komitmen aksi yang spesifik dan terlacak, seperti pola makan, transportasi, dan energi rumah, bukan sekadar skor pengetahuan sesaat.": "Literacy quizzes and games turn concepts into specific, tracked action commitments, such as diet, transport, and home energy, not just a momentary knowledge score.",
  "Kulakan / Panen": "Sourcing / harvest",
  "Kulakan/panen, proses, kemas, dan distribusi masing-masing menyumbang jejak. Karena datanya lahir di sumber, angka bisa diaudit dan titik pemangkasan jadi jelas.": "Wholesale or harvest, processing, packaging, and distribution each add to the footprint. Because the data is born at the source, the figures can be audited and the points to cut become clear.",
  "Kumpulan halaman pendaratan untuk berbagai tujuan pemasaran — dari alat konsumen hingga penawaran enterprise. Kunjungi, pratinjau, dan pilih yang paling pas untuk kampanyemu.": "A collection of landing pages for different marketing goals — from consumer tools to enterprise offers. Visit, preview, and pick the one that fits your campaign best.",
  "Kumpulkan poin, jaga streak, naik leaderboard komunitas/kampus — dan tebus jadi pohon nyata di Tree Marketplace.": "Collect points, keep your streak, climb the community/campus leaderboard — and redeem them for real trees in the Tree Marketplace.",
  "Kunci penghematan dari papan efisiensi, lalu tampilkan komitmen hijau yang bisa ditelusuri (offset pohon) di outlet & kemasan.": "Lock in the savings from the efficiency board, then display a traceable green commitment (tree offsets) at the outlet & on the packaging.",
