  "Kurangi di sumber, bukan hanya offset": "Cut at the source, not only offset",
  "Kurangi dulu, lalu salurkan kontribusi lewat aset hijau nyata, atau tukar kreditnya. Setiap kontribusi tertaut ke petak asalnya, dan akan tersimpan di dompet karbonmu. Kami menyebutnya kontribusi — bukan klaim netral karbon.": "Reduce first, then channel a contribution through real green assets, or trade the credit. Every contribution is linked to the plot it came from, and is held in your carbon wallet. We call it a contribution — not a carbon neutral claim.",
