  "Lacak & salurkan": "Track & contribute",
  "Lacak jejak per lini, temukan peluang penghematan biaya, dan tunjukkan komitmen hijau yang terlacak ke sumbernya saat mitra korporat menanyakannya.": "Track the footprint per line, find cost-saving opportunities, and show a green commitment tracked back to its source when corporate partners ask for it.",
