  "Lahannya dulu — nyata, berkoordinat, batasnya digambar dan luasnya dihitung. Kontribusi menempel pada petak itu, dan riwayat tutupannya bisa dibuka kapan saja. Pendaftaran pemilik lahan sendiri masih ditunda ⚠︎.": "The land first — real, with coordinates, its boundary drawn and its area computed. A contribution attaches to that plot, and the canopy cover history can be opened at any time. Landowner registration itself is still on hold ⚠︎.",
