  "Laode memulai Glyiv — memimpin produk, strategi, dan eksekusi. Keyakinannya sederhana: pasar karbon penuh angka tebakan, dan cara memperbaikinya adalah menghasilkan data di sumbernya, bukan menebak dari rata-rata pengeluaran.": "Laode started Glyiv — leading product, strategy, and execution. His conviction is simple: the carbon market is full of guessed numbers, and the way to fix it is to generate the data at source, not infer it from average spending.",
