  "Latihan mencocokkan kapasitas serapan area yang Anda pantau dengan permintaan perusahaan yang dibangkitkan sistem. Tidak ada transaksi di halaman ini.": "An exercise in matching the absorption capacity of the areas you monitor with system-generated company requests. There is no transaction on this page.",
  "Layanan berjalan di infrastruktur awan dan Glyiv belum menawarkan jaminan ketersediaan (SLA) formal. Gangguan yang kami ketahui akan diberitahukan. Papan kasir tetap menampilkan pesanan yang sudah masuk saat koneksi terputus, dan pesanan yang Anda simpan akan terkirim ketika internet kembali.": "The service runs on cloud infrastructure and Glyiv does not yet offer a formal availability guarantee (SLA). Disruptions we know about will be announced. The point-of-payment board keeps showing orders that already arrived when the connection drops, and the orders you save are sent once the internet returns.",
  "Layanan salah satu outlet Anda dihentikan sementara oleh Glyiv.": "Glyiv has temporarily stopped the service of one of your outlets.",
  "Layar titik bayar untuk petugas outlet: pesanan masuk, pembayaran, cetak struk.": "The point-of-payment screen for outlet staff: incoming orders, payment, receipt printing.",
