  "listrik": "electricity",
  "Listrik": "Electricity",
  "Listrik (terutama chiller/kulkas & pencahayaan) ~73% jejak toko. Ganti ke lemari pendingin inverter + LED dan matikan chiller kosong bisa memangkas ~20-30% listrik; kurangi kantong plastik sekali pakai (kontributor kecil tapi nilai naratif tinggi ke pelanggan). Skala UMKM membuat efisiensi energi ROI-nya cepat via penghematan tagihan PLN.": "Electricity (mainly chillers/refrigeration & lighting) is ~73% of the shop's footprint. Switching to inverter chillers + LED and turning off empty chillers can cut ~20-30% of electricity; reduce single-use plastic bags (a small contributor but with high narrative value to customers). At MSME scale, energy efficiency pays back fast through savings on the PLN bill.",
  "Listrik gedung (Scope 2) ~81% jejak — konversi ke PLTS atap plus pengadaan REC/energi terbarukan bisa memangkas hampir seluruhnya dan paling scalable lintas instansi. Armada dinas terbesar kedua (~19%); elektrifikasi bertahap + rasionalisasi perjalanan jauh lebih berdampak daripada kebijakan 'paperless' yang hanya menyentuh <1% jejak. Jadikan pengadaan hijau (green public procurement) pengungkit utama.": "Building electricity (Scope 2) is ~81% of the footprint — converting to rooftop solar plus REC/renewable energy procurement can cut nearly all of it, and is the most scalable move across agencies. The official fleet is the second largest (~19%); phased electrification + rationalizing travel is far more consequential than a 'paperless' policy that touches only <1% of the footprint. Make green public procurement the main lever.",
  "Listrik gedung perkantoran pemerintah": "Government office building electricity",
  "Listrik gedung perkantoran pemerintah · 81%": "Government office building electricity · 81%",
  "Listrik gedung perkantoran pemerintah (kWh)": "Electricity for government office buildings (kWh)",
  "Listrik gerai (chiller, mesin kopi, pencahayaan)": "Store electricity (chiller, coffee machine, lighting)",
  "Listrik gerai (chiller, mesin kopi, pencahayaan) (kWh)": "Outlet electricity (chiller, coffee machine, lighting) (kWh)",
  "Listrik jaringan (PLN)": "Grid electricity (PLN)",
  "Listrik jaringan (PLN) · 84%": "Grid electricity (PLN) · 84%",
  "Listrik jaringan (PLN) (kWh)": "Grid electricity (PLN) (kWh)",
  "Listrik jaringan kantor cabang & data center": "Grid electricity for branches & data centres",
  "Listrik jaringan kantor cabang & data center (kWh)": "Grid electricity for branch offices & data centre (kWh)",
  "Listrik kantor manajer investasi": "Investment manager office electricity",
  "Listrik kantor manajer investasi (kWh)": "Investment manager office electricity (kWh)",
  "Listrik mendominasi (~95% pada default) dan besarnya diperkuat PUE serta grid kotor 0,68. Dua lever: (1) turunkan PUE via free/liquid cooling & containment — tiap penurunan 0,1 PUE memangkas ~10% total listrik fasilitas; (2) PPA renewable/REC untuk menekan EF Scope 2. Kebocoran refrigeran kecil dalam volume tetapi berdampak tinggi per kg (GWP >2.000) — deteksi bocor rutin murah dan efektif. Laporkan angka berbasis kWh terukur meter, bukan nameplate.": "Electricity dominates (~95% at default) and its scale is amplified by PUE and a dirty grid at 0.68. Two levers: (1) lower PUE via free/liquid cooling & containment — every 0.1 drop in PUE cuts ~10% of the facility's total electricity; (2) a renewable PPA/REC to push down the Scope 2 EF. Refrigerant leakage is small in volume but high-impact per kg (GWP >2,000) — routine leak detection is cheap and effective. Report figures based on metered kWh, not nameplate.",
  "Listrik rumah sakit (24/7: OK, ICU, HVAC, imaging)": "Hospital electricity (24/7: theatres, ICU, HVAC, imaging)",
  "Listrik rumah sakit (24/7: OK, ICU, HVAC, imaging) · 81%": "Hospital electricity (24/7: theatres, ICU, HVAC, imaging) · 81%",
