  "Liv menyambut pelanggan, mengenali preferensi, dan merekomendasikan menu sesuai mood & cuaca. Lagi capek? Liv saranin yang bikin melek. Cuaca terik? Liv tahu yang paling seger.": "Liv greets customers, learns their preferences, and recommends items based on mood & weather. Feeling drained? Liv knows what'll perk you up. Blazing heat outside? Liv's got the coolest pick.",
