  "Menghubungkan manusia, alam, teknologi, dan ekonomi — agar setiap langkah menuju hidup yang sehat dan berkelanjutan bisa dilacak dan dipercaya.": "Connecting people, nature, technology, and the economy — so every step toward a healthy and sustainable life can be tracked and trusted.",
  "mengikuti kerangka GHG Protocol & ISO 14064, dalam format yang bisa dipakai sebagai bahan awal penyusunan EPD — penerbitannya tetap oleh operator program EPD": "following the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064 frameworks, in a format usable as starting material for preparing an EPD — issuance remains with the EPD programme operator",
  "mengikuti kerangka GHG Protocol & ISO 14064, dengan jejak perhitungan yang bisa ditelusuri pembeli dan pemodal": "following the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064 frameworks, with a calculation trail buyers and financiers can trace",
  "mengimbangi jejak pengiriman armadanya": "offsetting the footprint of its fleet deliveries",
  "mengimbangi konsumsi listrik pusat datanya": "offsetting the electricity consumption of its data centre",
  "Mengubah rasa peduli jadi paham — dan paham jadi": "Turning caring into understanding — and understanding into",
  "Mengukur dan menyimpan tetap jalan tanpa akun. Akun hanya dibutuhkan saat mengunggah antrean — server menolak tulisan tanpa pemilik.": "Measuring and saving still work without an account. An account is only needed when you upload the queue — the server rejects writes with no owner.",
  "Mengukur dan menyimpan tidak pernah membutuhkan jaringan maupun akun. Yang membutuhkan keduanya hanyalah mengunggah. Antrean terunggah sendiri begitu jaringan kembali, dan": "Measuring and saving never require a network or an account. Only uploading requires both. The queue uploads itself as soon as the network returns, and",
  "Mengunggah sertifikat ke Glyiv TIDAK memverifikasi kepemilikan lahan Anda. Kami tidak memeriksa keasliannya, tidak mencocokkannya ke BPN, dan tidak menerbitkan pengakuan apa pun. Yang terjadi hanyalah berkasnya terlacak bersama area yang Anda simpan.": "Uploading a certificate to Glyiv does NOT verify your ownership of the land. We do not check its authenticity, we do not match it against BPN, and we issue no recognition of any kind. All that happens is that the file is tracked alongside the area you save.",
  "Menimbang jejak, bukan menebak": "Weighing the footprint, not guessing",
  "Menit aktif": "Active minutes",
  "Menjadikan hidup hijau sebagai pilihan yang": "Making green living the choice that",
  "Menjaga server outlet hidup di satu tablet.": "Keeps the outlet server running on a single tablet.",
  "Menjangkau pasar global butuh jembatan yang sengaja dibangun. Julius dan Tobias memegang International Relations — memetakan jaringan, mendekati calon mitra strategis, dan membuka jalan ke standar & pasar Eropa. Tim produk membangunnya; mereka menghubungkannya ke dunia.": "Reaching global markets requires a bridge built on purpose. Julius and Tobias hold International Relations — mapping networks, approaching prospective strategic partners, and opening the way to European standards & markets. The product team builds it; they connect it to the world.",
  "Menjembatani data lapangan (IoT, citra) ke on-chain lewat oracle (mis. Chainlink Proof of Reserve) agar klaim serapan bisa": "Bridging field data (IoT, imagery) on-chain through an oracle (e.g. Chainlink Proof of Reserve) so that absorption claims can",
  "Menjembatani Glyiv ke jaringan & peluang internasional.": "Bridging Glyiv to international networks & opportunities.",
  "menjembatani tiga sumber:": "bridges three sources:",
  "menolak": "refuse",
  "Menolak berkas dari luar Play Store adalah perilaku bawaan Android, dan itu memang seharusnya. Anda perlu mengizinkannya satu kali:": "Refusing a file from outside the Play Store is Android's default behaviour, and rightly so. You need to allow it once:",
