  "Menyiram seluruh petak yang terlihat di layar sekaligus.": "Waters every plot visible on screen at once.",
  "Menyorot kebocoran biaya": "It highlights cost leaks",
  "menyusun inventarisasi emisi daerah secara berkala lewat konsultan menyerap biaya besar dan waktu berbulan-bulan": "building a regional emissions inventory periodically through consultants absorbs large costs and months of time",
  "meraih peringkat 3 di Indibiz Business Competition.": "ranked 3rd at the Indibiz Business Competition.",
  "merawat pohon & lahan": "tend the trees & land",
  "Merchant hanya mengisi resep — data yang memang sudah mereka punya untuk menghitung HPP. Angka karbonnya kami yang hitung, lengkap dengan rentang dan mutu datanya.": "Merchants only fill in the recipe — data they already keep in order to work out cost of goods. We compute the carbon figure, complete with its range and its data quality.",
  "Merchant QRIS Indonesia": "QRIS merchants in Indonesia",
  "merchant tumbuh": "merchants grow",
  "Merintis kemitraan institusi & peluang lintas-negara — agar Glyiv relevan di panggung internasional sejak hari pertama.": "Pioneering institutional partnerships & cross-border opportunities — so that Glyiv is relevant on the international stage from day one.",
  "MESIN": "THE ENGINE",
  "Mesin hibrida bertingkat: makin baik datanya, makin akurat estimasinya. Kami jujur soal ketidakpastian — itu yang membuatnya kredibel di mata investor & regulator.": "A tiered hybrid engine: better data means sharper estimates. We’re transparent about uncertainty — and that’s precisely what makes it credible to investors & regulators.",
  "Mesin Karbon": "Carbon Engine",
  "Mesin karbon kami memetakan tiap produk ke faktor emisi lewat LCA berbasis aktivitas, dengan fallback spend-based EEIO ketika data mentah belum lengkap. Lapisan AI agentik menormalkan katalog jutaan SKU yang berantakan, mengklasifikasikan kategori, dan menandai anomali agar angka tetap dapat diaudit. Saat checkout, konsumen bisa menambahkan langkah offset ke proyek yang bisa ditelusuri.": "Our carbon engine maps each product to an emission factor through activity-based LCA, with a spend-based EEIO fallback where raw data is not yet complete. An agentic AI layer normalizes messy catalogues of millions of SKUs, classifies categories, and flags anomalies so the numbers stay auditable. At checkout, consumers can add an offset step toward projects that can be traced.",
  "Meta-analisis ~38.700 farm; dasar intensitas emisi pangan.": "Meta-analysis of ~38,700 farms; the basis for food emission intensity.",
  "MetaMask atau dompet kripto apa pun — tidak sekarang, dan tidak untuk memakai halaman mana pun di Glyiv Hijau. Penerbitan aset lahan sebagai token (ERC-3643) masih berjalan di jaringan uji dan statusnya peta jalan ⚠︎. Kalau kelak dompet web3 hadir, ia opsional dan tidak akan pernah menjadi syarat masuk.": "MetaMask or any crypto wallet — not now, and not to use any page in Glyiv Green Assets. Issuing land assets as tokens (ERC-3643) still runs on a test network and its status is roadmap ⚠︎. If a web3 wallet ever arrives, it will be optional and will never become a condition of entry.",
  "Metana dari kolam limbah pabrik (POME) yang terbuang begitu saja": "Methane from mill effluent ponds (POME) simply vented away",
  "Metana dari POME adalah hotspot yang paling murah ditekan: instalasi biogas capture (methane capture + flare/genset) dapat memangkas ~60–70% emisi pabrik dan sekaligus menghasilkan listrik. Namun jika kebun berada di lahan gambut, emisi drainase gambut mengerdilkan semua faktor lain — angka LUC harus diverifikasi per estate (⚠︎ jangan pakai default), bukan diratakan. Rekomendasi: pisahkan pelaporan 'CPO tanpa LUC' vs 'dengan LUC' agar klaim tetap jujur dan bankable untuk RSPO/ISPO.": "Methane from POME is the cheapest hotspot to suppress: installing biogas capture (methane capture + flare/genset) can cut mill emissions by ~60–70% and generate electricity at the same time. But if the plantation sits on peatland, peat drainage emissions dwarf every other factor — LUC figures must be verified per estate (⚠︎ do not use defaults), not averaged out. Recommendation: report 'CPO without LUC' separately from 'with LUC' so the claim stays honest and bankable for RSPO/ISPO.",
  "Meteran Energi": "Energy meter",
  "Metode item-based diterapkan di grocery store — bukan lagi sekadar estimasi kategori.": "Item-based methodology applied to grocery stores — no more rough category estimates.",
  "Metodologi · bisa dipertanggungjawabkan": "Methodology · defensible",
  "Metodologi & tata kelola yang selaras standar internasional sejak hari pertama.": "Methodology & governance aligned with international standards from day one.",
  "Metodologi dan tata kelola yang selaras standar internasional sejak hari pertama.": "Methodology and governance aligned with international standards from day one.",
  "metodologi kami selaras standar & riset internasional yang bisa kamu periksa.": "our methodology is aligned with international standards & research that you can check.",
  "Metodologi selaras standar & riset internasional (GHG Protocol, ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, EXIOBASE).": "Methodology aligned with international standards & research (GHG Protocol, ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, EXIOBASE).",
  "Metodologi terbuka": "Open methodology",
  "Metodologi: activity-based process-LCA (aktivitas × faktor emisi) selaras GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; faktor dari ecoinvent, DEFRA/DESNZ, IEA, worldsteel, GCCA, EXIOBASE, IPCC. Faktor global/rata-rata — verifikasi spesifik-lokasi diperlukan sebelum pelaporan resmi. Sertifikasi dalam roadmap.": "Methodology: activity-based process-LCA (activity × emission factor) aligned with the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; factors from ecoinvent, DEFRA/DESNZ, IEA, worldsteel, GCCA, EXIOBASE, IPCC. Global/average factors — site-specific verification is required before official reporting. Certification on the roadmap.",
  "Metodologi: emisi dihitung activity-LCA (resep × faktor emisi bahan) dengan fallback spend-based EXIOBASE saat data bahan belum lengkap. Faktor bahan ≈ Poore & Nemecek,": "Methodology: emissions are computed with activity-LCA (recipe × ingredient emission factor) with a spend-based EXIOBASE fallback when ingredient data is incomplete. Ingredient factors ≈ Poore & Nemecek,",
