  "Modal shift adalah lever terbesar: angkutan laut (~0,016) sekitar 12× lebih rendah per ton.km dibanding truk rigid (~0,19). Untuk armada sendiri, kombinasi optimasi rute + peningkatan faktor muat (menghindari backhaul kosong) biasanya memangkas 10–20% liter/ton terkirim tanpa capex besar. Prioritaskan pengukuran ton.km aktual per shipment (bukan estimasi jarak lurus) agar klaim Scope 3 'terlacak', bukan sekadar 'terukur' asumsi.": "Modal shift is the largest lever: sea freight (~0.016) is about 12× lower per tonne.km than a rigid truck (~0.19). For an own fleet, route optimization + a higher load factor (avoiding empty backhaul) typically cuts 10–20% of litres per tonne delivered without major capex. Prioritize actual tonne.km per shipment (not straight-line distance estimates) so the Scope 3 claim is 'tracked', not merely 'measured' from assumptions.",
  "Mode luring": "Offline mode",
  "Mode pewarnaan peta": "Map colouring mode",
  "Model bisnis": "Business model",
  "Model di perangkat mengenali jenis sampah & pola pemakaian; servo menyortir ke sekat yang tepat.": "An on-device model recognises waste type & usage patterns; a servo sorts it into the right compartment.",
  "Model hutan 3D petak terpilih": "3D forest model of the selected plot",
  "Model lama gagal menskalakan di pasar berdaya beli menengah karena melawan insentif ekonomi sehari-hari. Ketika hidup hijau menghasilkan imbalan, edukasi berhenti jadi kewajiban moral — ia menjadi": "The old model failed to scale in a mid-purchasing-power market because it worked against everyday economic incentives. When living green produces a reward, education stops being a moral duty — it becomes",
  "Model representatif per kategori (PCR/PEFCR) + dataset terbaik. Keseimbangan akurasi & cakupan.": "Representative model per category (PCR/PEFCR) + best-available datasets. The right balance of accuracy & coverage.",
  "MODEL SIMULASI": "SIMULATION MODEL",
