  "Modul agribisnis masih tahap rancangan — kami membuka percakapan dengan calon mitra uji coba. Minta demo yang disesuaikan, atau whitepaper metodologi di bawah NDA.": "The agribusiness module is still at design stage — we are opening conversations with prospective pilot partners. Request a tailored demo, or the methodology whitepaper under NDA.",
  "Modul armada masih tahap rancangan — kami membuka percakapan dengan calon mitra uji coba. Minta demo yang disesuaikan, atau whitepaper metodologi di bawah NDA.": "The fleet module is still at design stage — we are opening conversations with prospective pilot partners. Request a tailored demo, or the methodology whitepaper under NDA.",
  "Modul dMRV untuk proyek iklim": "dMRV module for climate projects",
  "Modul Green Intelligence Platform untuk agribisnis dirancang melacak emisi kebun, pabrik, dan armada, lalu menautkannya ke plot berbasis geolokasi. ⚠︎ Glyiv": "The Green Intelligence Platform module for agribusiness is designed to track emissions from plantations, mills, and fleets, then link them to geolocated plots. ⚠︎ Glyiv",
  "Modul Green Intelligence Platform untuk armada dirancang melacak emisi per kendaraan, per rute, dan per pengiriman, sehingga penguapan itu terlihat. ⚠︎ Modul ini masih": "The Green Intelligence Platform module for fleets is designed to track emissions per vehicle, per route, and per delivery, so that what evaporates becomes visible. ⚠︎ This module is still",
  "Modul Green Intelligence Platform untuk lembaga keuangan dirancang agar emisi yang dibiayai portofolio Anda terlacak, bukan ditebak. ⚠︎ Modul ini masih": "The Green Intelligence Platform module for financial institutions is designed so that the emissions financed by your portfolio are tracked, not guessed. ⚠︎ This module is still",
  "Modul Green Intelligence Platform untuk manajer aset dirancang agar emisi di balik setiap saham dan obligasi kelolaan terlacak per emiten, sektor, dan dana. ⚠︎ Modul ini masih": "The Green Intelligence Platform module for asset managers is designed so the emissions behind every share and bond under management are tracked by issuer, sector, and fund. ⚠︎ This module is still",
  "Modul industri berat masih tahap rancangan — kami membuka percakapan dengan calon mitra uji coba. Minta demo yang disesuaikan, atau whitepaper metodologi di bawah NDA.": "The heavy industry module is still at the design stage — we are opening conversations with prospective pilot partners. Request a tailored demo, or the methodology whitepaper under NDA.",
  "Modul interaktif menghitung jejak karbon aktivitas harian Anda dengan metodologi activity-based LCA (faktor emisi ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, DEFRA, IPCC), dengan fallback spend-based EEIO (EXIOBASE) bila data aktivitas terbatas.": "An interactive module computes the carbon footprint of your daily activity with activity-based LCA methodology (emission factors from ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, DEFRA, IPCC), with a spend-based EEIO fallback (EXIOBASE) where activity data is limited.",
  "Modul keuangan masih tahap rancangan — kami membuka percakapan dengan calon mitra uji coba. Minta demo yang disesuaikan, atau whitepaper metodologi di bawah NDA.": "The finance module is still at design stage — we are opening conversations with prospective pilot partners. Request a tailored demo, or the methodology whitepaper under NDA.",
  "Modul manajemen aset masih tahap rancangan — kami membuka percakapan dengan calon mitra uji coba. Minta demo yang disesuaikan, atau whitepaper metodologi di bawah NDA.": "The asset management module is still at design stage — we are opening conversations with prospective pilot partners. Request a tailored demo, or the methodology whitepaper under NDA.",
