  "Objek acuan (penggaris 30 cm, kertas A4 = 21 cm, atau parang yang sudah Anda ukur) harus berada di bidang yang sama dengan batang — tempelkan, jangan dipegang di depan. Acuan yang lebih dekat ke kamera daripada batang membuat batang terhitung lebih kecil daripada aslinya.": "The reference object (a 30 cm ruler, A4 paper = 21 cm, or a machete whose length you already know) must sit in the same plane as the trunk — hold it flat against the bark, not in front of it. A reference closer to the camera than the trunk makes the trunk come out smaller than it really is.",
