  "OCR struk & klasifikasi item ke kategori emisi sudah berjalan. Agen yang menganalisis, menandai temuan, dan menyarankan tindakan masih dikembangkan — keputusan tetap di tangan manusia.": "Receipt OCR & classification of items into emission categories are already running. The agent that analyses, flags findings, and suggests action is still in development — decisions stay with people.",
  "OCR struk…": "Receipt OCR…",
  "Offset & simpan aset": "Offset & store the asset",
  "Offset Anda bersandar pada pohon yang benar-benar tumbuh — dipantau lewat citra satelit dan diterbitkan sebagai aset dunia-nyata (RWA, ERC-3643 — masih testnet ⚠︎). Rekonsiliasi ke registri resmi dan verifikasi pihak ketiga masih peta jalan ⚠︎, dan kami menyebutnya apa adanya.": "Your offsets rest on trees that genuinely grow — monitored through satellite imagery and issued as real-world assets (RWA, ERC-3643 — still testnet ⚠︎). Reconciliation with the official registry and third-party verification are still roadmap ⚠︎, and we call them what they are.",
  "Offset di checkout": "Offset at checkout",
  "Offset dilaporkan sendiri": "Self-reported offsets",
  "Offset itu penting — tapi tidak menghapus emisi.": "Offsets matter — but they do not erase emissions.",
  "Offset karbon punya reputasi buruk — penuh 'kredit zombie' yang tak jelas asalnya. Tokenisasi aset pohon nyata mengubahnya: dari klaim di atas kertas menjadi bukti yang dipantau satelit dan tercatat di rantai.": "Carbon offsets have a bad name — full of 'zombie credits' whose origin is unclear. Tokenising real tree assets changes that: from a claim on paper to evidence watched by satellite and recorded on-chain.",
  "offset pohon tertokenisasi yang jejaknya bisa ditelusuri pelanggan — kontribusi yang terlacak, bukan klaim netral karbon": "tokenised tree offsets whose trail customers can follow — a tracked contribution, not a carbon neutral claim",
  "oleh AI trash-bin": "by the AI trash bin",
  "oleh apa pun yang Anda tekan di halaman ini. Terlacak, bukan terukur — sertifikasi dan verifikasi pihak ketiga masih peta jalan.": "by anything you press on this page. Tracked, not measured — certification and third-party verification are still roadmap.",
  "oleh proses unggah — ia hanya ditandai terunggah setelah server mengonfirmasi. Penyimpanan terpakai": "by the upload process — it is only marked as uploaded after the server confirms. Storage used",
