  "Outlet baru mendapat masa coba 1 bulan (30 hari kalender) ATAU 500 transaksi, mana yang lebih dulu tercapai, terhitung sejak outlet dibuat. Selama masa coba seluruh fitur menyala penuh dan tidak ada biaya. Batas 500 transaksi diperiksa Glyiv secara berkala, sehingga outlet bisa sesaat melewatinya sebelum ditinjau.": "A new outlet gets a 1-month trial (30 calendar days) OR 500 transactions, whichever comes first, counted from the moment the outlet is created. During the trial every feature is fully on and there is no charge. The 500-transaction limit is checked by Glyiv periodically, so an outlet may briefly pass it before it is reviewed.",
