  "outlet yang memakai sistem Glyiv langsung mulai membangun jejak karbonnya sendiri — tanpa pekerjaan tambahan bagi tim Anda": "an outlet using the Glyiv system starts building its own carbon footprint straight away — with no extra work for your team",
  "Pada default ini jejak didominasi baja (~9.600 tCO2e) + aluminium (~7.400 tCO2e) ≈ 18.250 tCO2e/tahun. Setara ~830.000 pohon/tahun (asumsi ~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎ perlu diverifikasi per spesies & iklim). Postur: prioritaskan reduksi (scrap-EAF menurunkan baja ke ~0,7 t/ton) sebelum kompensasi — offset menutup sisa (kontribusi), bukan mengklaim netral.": "In this default the footprint is dominated by steel (~9,600 tCO2e) + aluminium (~7,400 tCO2e) ≈ 18,250 tCO2e/year. Equivalent to ~830,000 trees/year (assuming ~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎ needs verification per species & climate). Posture: prioritise reduction (scrap-EAF brings steel down to ~0.7 t/ton) before compensation — offsets cover the remainder (a contribution), they do not claim neutrality.",
  "pada jam sepi — potensi hemat": "during quiet hours — potential savings",
  "pada jejak sekecil itu, kontribusi offset lewat reforestasi masuk akal secara biaya bagi UMKM — kontribusi terlacak, bukan klaim netral karbon": "at a footprint that small, an offset contribution through reforestation makes cost sense for MSMEs — a tracked contribution, not a carbon neutral claim",
  "Padahal ada di tiap pilihan.": "Yet it sits in every choice.",
  "padahal bisa ditangkap jadi biogas dan menekan biaya energi": "when it could be captured as biogas and cut energy costs",
  "Padanan pohon hanya gambaran skala. Memindai atau mencatat barang TIDAK menebus emisinya dan tidak membuat siapa pun netral karbon. ≈21,8 kg CO₂e/pohon/tahun (±48 pon/tahun) — figur penyuluhan kehutanan kota (Arbor Day Foundation / USDA Forest Service), angka yang sama dipakai kalkulator Glyiv. ⚠︎ Bukan hasil pengukuran; laju nyata berbeda jauh menurut spesies, umur, dan iklim.": "The tree equivalence is only a sense of scale. Scanning or logging an item does NOT redeem its emissions and does not make anyone carbon neutral. ≈21.8 kg CO₂e/tree/year (±48 lb/year) — an urban forestry outreach figure (Arbor Day Foundation / USDA Forest Service), the same number used by the Glyiv calculator. ⚠︎ Not the result of a measurement; real rates differ widely by species, age, and climate.",
