  "Pasar": "Market",
  "Pasar aset hijau tumbuh cepat, tetapi dipenuhi klaim tanpa bukti. Investor sulit membedakan dampak nyata dari greenwashing, karena kredit karbon dan proyek pohon sering dijual sebagai narasi, bukan sebagai kontribusi yang terlacak. Tanpa metodologi dan rantai bukti yang jelas, modal berisiko membiayai angka yang tidak bisa dipertanggungjawabkan.": "The green assets market is growing fast, but it is crowded with claims that carry no evidence. Investors struggle to separate real impact from greenwashing, because carbon credits and tree projects are often sold as a narrative rather than as a tracked contribution. Without a clear methodology and chain of evidence, capital risks financing numbers that cannot be defended.",
  "Pasar hari ini · benih": "Today's market · seed",
  "Pasar karbon diatur ketat: unit karbon = efek (POJK 14/2023), peserta bursa = badan hukum. Glyiv menempuh bertahap: mulai sebagai penyedia MRV-software, lalu (opsional) LVV terakreditasi (KAN/ISO 17029 & 14065) sebagai entitas terpisah demi independensi.": "Carbon markets are tightly regulated: carbon units = effects (POJK 14/2023), exchange participants = legal entities. Glyiv proceeds in stages: starting as an MRV-software provider, then (optionally) as an accredited LVV (KAN/ISO 17029 & 14065) under a separate entity for full independence.",
  "Pasar karbon punya reputasi buruk karena \"kredit zombie\" — kredit lama berkualitas rendah yang dipindah-pindahkan sampai asal-usulnya kabur. Kami menolak model itu, dan memilih memulai dari petak yang bisa ditunjuk.": "The carbon market has a bad name because of \"zombie credits\" — old, low-quality credits passed around until their origin blurs. We reject that model, and choose to start from a plot you can point at.",
  "Pasar kebutuhan karbon": "Carbon demand market",
  "Pasokan petani swadaya": "Smallholder supply",
