  "PCF pihak ketiga": "Third-party PCF",
  "PDB dunia diwakili yurisdiksi yang sudah melangkah mengadopsi standar pelaporan iklim (IFRS S2).": "of world GDP is represented by jurisdictions that have moved to adopt climate reporting standards (IFRS S2).",
  "Peduli tinggi, pemahaman tertinggal.": "High concern, understanding left behind.",
