  "Pembayaran Anda menunggu diperiksa outlet. Meja tetap ditahan sampai 60 menit ke depan; kalau outlet belum sempat memeriksanya, hubungi outlet lewat nomor di halaman ini.": "Your payment is waiting to be checked by the outlet. The table stays held for the next 60 minutes; if the outlet has not checked it yet, call them on the number on this page.",
  "Pembayaran digital di Indonesia sudah mulus—satu pindai QRIS, selesai. Tapi di balik tiap transaksi ada emisi yang tak pernah muncul di struk. Selama jejak itu tidak tercatat, ia tetap tak kasat mata, dan yang tak terlacak mustahil dikelola.": "Digital payment in Indonesia is already seamless—one QRIS scan and it is done. But behind every transaction sit emissions that never appear on the receipt. As long as that footprint goes unrecorded, it stays invisible, and what is not tracked is impossible to manage.",
