  "Pemilik lahan mendaftarkan lahan yang ditanami → kapasitas serapan dihitung lewat NDVI/Google Earth Engine → di-tokenisasi lewat rel": "Landowners register planted land → absorption capacity is computed via NDVI/Google Earth Engine → tokenized on",
  "Pemilik lahan onboarding → kapasitas serapan dihitung lewat NDVI/Google Earth Engine → tiap hektar di-tokenisasi (ERC-721) lalu difraksi (ERC-3643). Institusi & retail membeli Carbon Absorption Token untuk mendanai dan menebus — disiplin MRV, selaras registri (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK).": "Landowners onboard → absorption capacity calculated via NDVI/Google Earth Engine → each hectare tokenized (ERC-721) then fractionalized (ERC-3643). Institutions & retailers buy Carbon Absorption Tokens to fund and retire credits — rigorous MRV discipline, aligned with registries (SRN-PPI/SRUK/SPE-GRK).",
  "pemilik lahan terdaftar": "registered land owners",
  "pemilik lain ⚠︎": "other owners ⚠︎",
  "Pemilik outlet adalah akun yang mendaftarkannya, dan hanya pemilik yang bisa membaca resep, harga pokok, laporan, serta menyetujui akun kasir. Kasir yang disetujui dapat menerima dan menjalankan pesanan serta mengelola ketersediaan menu, tetapi tidak dapat mengubah harga maupun membaca resep. Anda bertanggung jawab atas siapa yang Anda setujui sebagai kasir.": "The outlet owner is the account that registered it, and only the owner can read recipes, cost prices, and reports, and approve point-of-payment accounts. Approved point-of-payment staff can receive and run orders and manage menu availability, but cannot change prices or read recipes. You are responsible for whoever you approve as point-of-payment staff.",
  "Pemilik yang menyetujui permintaan Anda.": "The owner is the one who approves your request.",
