  "pendinginan berlebih menaikkan Power Usage Effectiveness; setiap 0,1 poin PUE adalah tagihan listrik dan emisi yang terbuang percuma": "over-cooling pushes up Power Usage Effectiveness; every 0.1 PUE point is an electricity bill and emissions thrown away for nothing",
  "Pendinginan sudah menjadi salah satu pendorong tercepat permintaan listrik dunia, dan sebagian besar pertumbuhannya terjadi di negara tropis seperti Indonesia. Di rumah, AC menyala tanpa jejak, meteran hanya menampilkan angka total di akhir bulan, dan sampah organik, plastik, serta anorganik bercampur sejak dari dapur. Yang tidak terlacak, tidak pernah bisa dikurangi.": "Cooling has become one of the fastest drivers of global electricity demand, and most of that growth is happening in tropical countries like Indonesia. At home the air conditioner runs leaving no trace, the meter shows only a single total at month's end, and organic, plastic, and inorganic waste mix together from the kitchen onward. What is not tracked can never be reduced.",
  "penentu karbon.": "the carbon driver.",
  "Pengalaman (opsional)": "Experience (optional)",
  "Pengalaman gamified: temukan lahanmu lewat koordinat, rawat pohon (sprite per-umur), panen imbalan. Retensi tinggi.": "A gamified experience: find your plot by coordinates, tend the trees (per-age sprites), harvest the rewards. High retention.",
