  "Penukaran belum dibuka. Efek keempat barang di atas belum dijalankan sistem, dan kepemilikannya belum bisa disimpan di dompet — kalau tombol tukar dibuka sekarang, poin Anda berkurang dan Anda tidak mendapat apa pun, bahkan sampai halaman dimuat ulang. Kami memilih mematikannya dan mengatakan alasannya.": "Redemption is not open. The effects of the four items above are not run by the system yet, and ownership of them cannot be stored in the wallet — if the redeem button were opened now, your points would go down and you would get nothing, not even until the page is reloaded. We chose to switch it off and to say why.",
