  "Pernah ikut penanaman, terbiasa memakai GPS, kenal daerahnya, atau kosongkan saja.": "Joined a planting before, comfortable with GPS, know the area — or just leave it blank.",
  "Perpres 98/2021 tentang Nilai Ekonomi Karbon adalah dasar hukum yang membuat sebuah pengurangan emisi bisa menjadi sertifikat SPE-GRK yang diakui negara — kami runut alurnya, dari lahan sampai registri, tanpa jargon.": "Presidential Regulation 98/2021 on the Economic Value of Carbon is the legal basis that lets an emission reduction become a state-recognised SPE-GRK certificate — we trace the flow, from land to registry, without jargon.",
  "Perpres NEK dan SPE-GRK: tulang punggung pasar karbon kita.": "Perpres NEK and SPE-GRK: the backbone of our carbon market.",
  "Pertambangan": "Mining",
  "Pertambangan dan pengolahan logam adalah tulang punggung ekspor Indonesia sekaligus penyumbang emisi Scope 1 terbesar di sektor riil, karena bergantung pada tungku dan captive power berbahan batu bara. Pembeli global, bank, dan regulator kini menilai setiap kargo bukan hanya dari kadar logamnya, tetapi dari intensitas karbon per ton. Tanpa angka karbon yang terlacak dan bisa ditelusuri asal-usulnya, komoditas Indonesia berisiko didiskon harga, kehilangan akses ke pasar premium (baterai EV, otomotif Eropa), dan dilabeli 'aset berisiko' oleh pemodal. Melacak karbon bukan beban kepatuhan — ia bagian dari mempertahankan nilai ekspor.": "Mining and metals processing are the backbone of Indonesia's exports and at the same time the largest Scope 1 emitters in the real sector, because they depend on furnaces and coal-fired captive power. Global buyers, banks, and regulators now judge each cargo not only by its metal content, but by its carbon intensity per tonne. Without carbon figures that are tracked and traceable to their origin, Indonesian commodities risk being discounted on price, losing access to premium markets (EV batteries, European automotive), and being labelled a 'risky asset' by financiers. Tracking carbon is not a compliance burden — it is part of defending export value.",
