  "Platform Intelijen Hijau & Offset Karbon. Lacak, hitung, dan offset emisi — dari lini operasi hingga neraca korporasi.": "Green Intelligence & Offset Platform. Track, calculate, and offset emissions — from the operating line to the corporate balance sheet.",
  "Platform intelijen hijau kelas enterprise: agen AI yang membaca data karbon perusahaan, menganalisis emisi terhadap biaya, lalu mengubahnya jadi keputusan. Lacak, hitung, offset — selaras GHG Protocol dan ISO 14064. Sertifikasi dan registri masih peta jalan, bukan kemampuan yang sudah jadi.": "Enterprise-grade green intelligence platform: AI agents that read a company's carbon data, analyse emissions against cost, then turn that into decisions. Track, calculate, offset — aligned with the GHG Protocol and ISO 14064. Certification and the registry are still on the roadmap, not a shipped capability.",
  "Platform intelijen karbon kelas enterprise: sebuah agen AI yang membaca data karbon perusahaan, menganalisis emisi terhadap biaya, lalu mengubahnya menjadi keputusan. Lacak → Hitung → Offset. Selaras GHG Protocol & ISO 14064.": "An enterprise-grade carbon intelligence platform: an AI agent that reads a company's carbon data, analyses emissions against cost, then turns it into decisions. Track → Calculate → Offset. Aligned with the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064.",
  "Play Protect mungkin memperingatkan karena pemasangnya bukan Play Store. Itu wajar untuk berkas dari luar toko — pastikan SHA-256-nya cocok sebelum melanjutkan.": "Play Protect may warn you because the installer is not the Play Store. That is normal for a file from outside the store — make sure its SHA-256 matches before you continue.",
  "plus lacak-balak berbasis geolokasi sebagai bahan menjawab permintaan pembeli & regulator ekspor — audit dan sertifikasi tetap ranah lembaga berwenang": "plus geolocation-based chain of custody as material for answering buyer & export-regulator requests — audit and certification remain the domain of authorised bodies",
