  "Produksi semen menyumbang 7–8% emisi CO2 global, sebagian besar dari kalsinasi klinker yang tak bisa dihindari secara kimiawi. Modul GIP untuk industri berat dirancang melacak karbon terembodi per ton semen dan per proyek. ⚠︎ Glyiv": "Cement production accounts for 7–8% of global CO2 emissions, most of it from clinker calcination that is chemically unavoidable. The GIP module for heavy industry is designed to track embodied carbon per tonne of cement and per project. ⚠︎ Glyiv",
  "produksi TBS, konsumsi solar, dan POME — jejak karbon terhitung otomatis mengikuti kerangka GHG Protocol/ISO 14064": "FFB production, diesel consumption, and POME — the carbon footprint is computed automatically following the GHG Protocol/ISO 14064 framework",
