  "Punya lahan bervegetasi? Gambar batasnya, lihat luas terhitung dan estimasi serapannya ⚠︎, lalu pantau tutupannya. Pendaftaran pemilik lahan masih ditunda.": "Have vegetated land? Draw its boundary, see the computed area and its absorption estimate ⚠︎, then monitor its canopy cover. Landowner registration is still on hold.",
  "Punya lahan hutan, mangrove, agroforestri, atau lahan produktif? Daftarkan lahannya, tim Glyiv memetakan batasnya, lalu pertumbuhannya dipantau dan kontribusinya tercatat.": "Do you have forest, mangrove, agroforestry, or productive land? Register the land, the Glyiv team maps its boundary, then its growth is monitored and its contribution recorded.",
