  "Punya outlet atau toko? Daftarkan titik bayar Anda dan jalankan operasi berdata karbon — gratis 14 hari, tanpa perangkat baru dan tanpa mengganti sistem titik bayar yang sudah jalan.": "Have an outlet or a shop? Register your point of payment and run carbon-data operations — free for 14 days, with no new hardware and without replacing the point-of-payment system you already run.",
  "Punya outlet makanan-minuman atau ritel? Jalankan operasi hariannya di Glyiv dan angka karbon per item ikut turun otomatis dari resep — terlacak, tanpa isian manual.": "Do you run a food-and-drink or retail outlet? Run its daily operations on Glyiv and the per-item carbon figure falls out of the recipe automatically — tracked, with no manual entry.",
