  "Regulasi Anti-Deforestasi UE mewajibkan uji tuntas geolokasi untuk sawit, kopi, kakao, karet, dan kayu — \"bebas deforestasi\" berubah dari nilai tambah menjadi tiket masuk. Pemberlakuan penuh bagi pelaku besar ditunda hingga akhir 2025 ⚠︎.": "The EU Deforestation Regulation requires geolocation due diligence for palm oil, coffee, cocoa, rubber, and timber — \"deforestation-free\" turns from a premium into an entry ticket. Full application for large operators was postponed to the end of 2025 ⚠︎.",
  "Regulasi CBAM (UE) 2023/956 — jadwal penghapusan alokasi gratis": "CBAM Regulation (EU) 2023/956 — schedule for phasing out free allocation",
  "regulasi mengikuti.": "policy follows.",
  "Regulasi, teknologi, dan ekonomi karbon — tanpa jargon, tanpa membosankan. Cari, urutkan, ketuk": "Carbon regulation, technology, and economics — no jargon, never dull. Search, sort, tap",
  "Regulator mewajibkan pelaporan emisi, dan pasar karbon bernilai triliunan dolar. Namun sebagian besar angka emisi hari ini dihitung": "Regulators now mandate emissions reporting, and the carbon market is worth trillions of dollars. Yet most emission figures today are calculated",
  "Regulator mewajibkan pelaporan, pasar ekspor menagihnya, investor memberi harga pada risiko karbon. Pertanyaannya bukan lagi apakah angka karbon Anda akan diminta, tapi apakah angka itu bisa dipertanggungjawabkan saat diminta. Glyiv mengubah data emisi mentah menjadi catatan yang terlacak sampai ke aktivitas asalnya — bukan taksiran yang disusun di akhir tahun.": "Regulators require reporting, export markets demand it, investors price carbon risk. The question is no longer whether your carbon numbers will be asked for, but whether those numbers will stand up when they are. Glyiv turns raw emissions data into a record tracked all the way back to the activity that produced it — not a figure assembled at year end.",
