  "Rencana: luas, lokasi, status kepemilikan, tutupan saat ini, dan foto batas diisi lewat konsol Glyiv. Belum dibuka.": "The plan: area, location, ownership status, current canopy cover, and boundary photos are entered through the Glyiv console. Not open yet.",
  "Rencana: manusia, bukan otomatis — dokumen diperiksa dan batas dipetakan ulang di atas citra. Belum berjalan.": "Plan: human, not automated — documents are checked and boundaries re-mapped over imagery. Not yet running.",
  "Rencana: petak masuk Peta Aset Hijau dengan koordinat dan luas terhitung, tutupannya dibaca lewat segmentasi indeks vegetasi. Alat hitungnya sudah bisa Anda coba sekarang — yang belum ada adalah petak terdaftar di dalamnya.": "The plan: a plot enters the Green Assets Map with coordinates and a computed area, its canopy cover read through vegetation index segmentation. The calculation tool is already there for you to try — what does not exist yet is a registered plot inside it.",
  "Rencana: saat kontribusi masuk ke petak Anda, imbalannya tercatat di konsol. Tidak ada imbalan tetap yang kami janjikan di muka, dan tidak ada yang berjalan hari ini.": "The plan: when a contribution comes into your plot, the reward is recorded in the console. We promise no fixed reward up front, and none of this runs today.",
