  "Science. Meta-analisis LCA lintas ribuan pertanian; dasar faktor emisi pangan yang juga dipakai pustaka faktor emisi Glyiv.": "Science. An LCA meta-analysis across thousands of farms; the basis of the food emission factors also used by the Glyiv emission factor library.",
  "Scope 1, 2 & 3 per SKU": "Scope 1, 2 & 3 per SKU",
  "Scope 1, 2 dan 3 rumah sakit Anda disusun selaras GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; metodologinya dirinci di whitepaper kami di bawah NDA": "Your hospital's Scope 1, 2 and 3 are compiled in line with the GHG Protocol & ISO 14064; the methodology is detailed in our whitepaper under NDA",
  "Scope 3 (Kategori 15 - Investasi)": "Scope 3 (Category 15 – Investments)",
  "Scope 3 (Kategori 15 - Investasi/Financed Emissions)": "Scope 3 (Category 15 – Investments/Financed Emissions)",
  "Scope 3 yang tak terlacak adalah risiko dan biaya yang tak terlihat. Analisis CDP 2024 menemukan emisi rantai pasok rata-rata 11,4 kali lipat gabungan emisi Scope 1 & 2 sebuah perusahaan — artinya sebagian besar eksposur biaya karbon Anda tersembunyi di pembelian bahan, logistik, dan energi pemasok. Ketika rantai pasok dipetakan, terlihat pemasok berintensitas tinggi yang menaikkan jejak produk akhir, bahan baku boros energi yang bisa disubstitusi, dan lini yang tidak efisien. Tanpa peta ini, Anda menanggung tarif CBAM atas komponen ekspor, kehilangan kontrak dari merek yang mewajibkan Product Carbon Footprint, dan membayar energi yang terbuang tanpa pernah tahu di mana.": "Untracked Scope 3 is risk and cost you cannot see. CDP's 2024 analysis found that supply chain emissions average 11.4 times a company's combined Scope 1 & 2 emissions — meaning most of your carbon cost exposure is hidden in material purchases, logistics, and supplier energy. Once the supply chain is mapped, you can see the high-intensity suppliers that raise the final product's footprint, the energy-hungry raw materials that could be substituted, and the inefficient lines. Without that map, you absorb CBAM tariffs on exported components, lose contracts from brands that require a Product Carbon Footprint, and pay for wasted energy without ever knowing where.",
  "Scope campuran · ⚠︎ ilustrasi": "Mixed scope · ⚠︎ illustrative",
  "Sebagian besar alat karbon dirancang untuk korporasi besar — mahal, rumit, dan menakutkan bagi pemilik toko. Padahal justru UMKM ritel yang paling merasakan setiap rupiah tagihan listrik dan setiap barang yang basi. Glyiv membalik urutannya: alat sederhana yang jalan dari HP, menunjuk di mana toko boros energi, lalu — karena jejaknya kecil — membuka": "Most carbon tools are built for large corporations — expensive, complicated, and intimidating for a shop owner. Yet it is retail MSMEs that feel every rupiah of the electricity bill and every item that spoils. Glyiv reverses the order: a simple tool that runs from a phone, points to where the shop wastes energy, then — because the footprint is small — opens",
  "Sebagian besar cabang ekosistem di beranda masih peta jalan, dan kami menandainya begitu. Saku berbeda: ia": "Most ecosystem branches on the homepage are still roadmap, and we label them as such. Saku is different: it",
  "Sebagian besar jejak karbon Anda bukan di pabrik Anda —": "Most of your carbon footprint is not in your plant —",
  "Sebagian besar mengalir ke petak pohon & proyek yang dipantau di Tree Marketplace.": "Most of it flows to tree plots & projects monitored on the Tree Marketplace.",
  "Sebagian besar solusi karbon berhenti di dua langkah: ukur, lalu imbangi. Padahal emisi terbesar sering lahir dari": "Most carbon solutions stop at two steps: measure, then balance. Yet the largest emissions are often born of",
  "Sebagian dari tiap pesanan mengalir — secara transparan dan dapat diaudit — ke komunitas hijau mitra. Pelanggan mengumpulkan Green Points dan melihat persis ke mana dampaknya pergi.": "A portion of every order flows — transparently and auditably — to partner green communities. Customers earn Green Points and see exactly where their impact goes.",
  "Sebagian ponsel kantor dan perangkat yang dikelola perusahaan": "Some work phones and company-managed devices",
  "Sebagian sudah prototipe, sebagian masih visi. Tiap kartu menandai statusnya apa adanya — lengkap dengan demo atau ilustrasi konsepnya. Kami tidak mengklaim yang belum berjalan.": "Some are prototypes already, some are still vision. Each card marks its status plainly — with a demo or an illustration of the concept. We do not claim what is not yet running.",
  "Sebagian transaksi mengalir ke komunitas hijau": "A portion of every transaction flows to green communities",
  "Sebelum — tutupan rendah": "Before — low canopy cover",
  "sebelum berarti apa-apa. Sertifikasi, MRV, dan pendaftaran registri masih peta jalan Glyiv — bukan kemampuan yang sudah jalan.": "before it means anything. Certification, MRV, and registry listing are still on the Glyiv roadmap — not a capability that already runs.",
  "sebelum harga disepakati": "before the price is agreed",
  "sebelum memakai sidik itu sebagai bukti keaslian.": "before using that fingerprint as proof of authenticity.",
  "Sebelum memasang, cocokkan SHA-256 berkas yang Anda unduh dengan angka di kartunya — caranya ada di bagian bawah halaman. Dan baca dulu empat hal yang perlu diketahui sebelum memasang berkas dari luar Play Store.": "Before installing, match the SHA-256 of the file you downloaded against the number on its card — the how-to is at the bottom of this page. And read first the four things worth knowing before installing a file from outside the Play Store.",
