  "Semuanya adalah": "All of it is",
  "Semuanya punya versi web yang bisa dibuka sekarang. Versi Android-nya berkas APK — belum ada di Play Store, dan kami mengatakannya apa adanya.": "Every one of them has a web version you can open right now. The Android builds are APK files — not on the Play Store yet, and we say so plainly.",
  "Sensor / NDVI": "Sensor / NDVI",
  "Sentinel-2 · tutupan kanopi +1,2% · NDVI rata-rata 0,79.": "Sentinel-2 · canopy cover +1.2% · average NDVI 0.79.",
  "Seperti Gojek membuka penghasilan bagi jutaan orang, Glyiv membuka": "Just as Gojek opened up livelihoods for millions of people, Glyiv opens up",
  "Seperti Gojek yang dulu mendahului regulasi, Glyiv bertujuan menjadi infrastruktur publik digital yang market-driven — sebuah \"standar hijau\" yang dipercaya pasar, lalu diadopsi kebijakan. Dibangun bertahap, integritas dulu, agar kredibel di mata regulator & dunia.": "Like Gojek before regulation, Glyiv aims to become market-driven digital public infrastructure — a \"green standard\" trusted by the market, then adopted by policy. Built incrementally, integrity first, to earn credibility with regulators and the world.",
