  "Sudah berjalan di outlet rintisan kami: pesanan mandiri lewat QR, papan kasir, inventori & HPP, dan angka karbon per item yang diturunkan dari resep. Tanpa perangkat baru dan tanpa tim data. ⚠︎ Angkanya": "Already running in our pilot outlets: self-ordering via QR, the point-of-payment board, inventory & cost of goods, and a per-item carbon figure derived from the recipe. No new hardware and no data team. ⚠︎ The figures are",
