  "Sumber faktor: Poore & Nemecek 2018 (Science), Agribalyse (ADEME), ecoinvent, EXIOBASE (spend-based). Estimasi kategori — bukan Environmental Product Declaration resmi. ⚠︎ Verifikasi per-produk memerlukan data primer produsen.": "Factor sources: Poore & Nemecek 2018 (Science), Agribalyse (ADEME), ecoinvent, EXIOBASE (spend-based). A category-level estimate — not an official Environmental Product Declaration. ⚠︎ Per-product verification requires primary data from the producer.",
  "Sumber faktor: Poore & Nemecek 2018 (Science), Agribalyse (ADEME), ecoinvent, EXIOBASE (spend-based). Serapan pohon ~22 kgCO₂e/pohon/tahun bervariasi menurut spesies, umur & iklim ⚠︎. Estimasi kategori — bukan Environmental Product Declaration resmi.": "Factor sources: Poore & Nemecek 2018 (Science), Agribalyse (ADEME), ecoinvent, EXIOBASE (spend-based). Tree absorption of ~22 kgCO₂e/tree/year varies by species, age & climate ⚠︎. A category-level estimate — not an official Environmental Product Declaration.",
  "Sumber: World Bank (harga karbon 2024), Ecosystem Marketplace (VCM 2024), IDXCarbon. Angka pasar — bukan proyeksi Glyiv.": "Sources: World Bank (carbon pricing 2024), Ecosystem Marketplace (VCM 2024), IDXCarbon. Market figures — not Glyiv projections.",
