  "Tabelnya belum bisa dibaca sampai zonanya dipilih. Zona tidak ditebak: menebaknya berarti menaruh lahan Anda di tempat yang salah tanpa satu pun peringatan.": "The table cannot be read until a zone is chosen. The zone is never guessed: guessing would put your land in the wrong place without a single warning.",
  "Tagihan berhenti di angka total. Glyiv turun ke aktivitas yang menghasilkannya — mesin mana, rute mana, jam berapa, lini apa — lalu menandai mana yang boros dan berapa nilainya. Itu sebabnya pekerjaan karbon paling sering dimulai bukan dari kewajiban lapor, melainkan dari tagihan yang terlalu besar.": "A bill stops at the total. Glyiv goes down to the activity that produced it — which machine, which route, which hour, which line — then flags what is wasteful and what it is worth. That is why carbon work most often starts not from a reporting obligation, but from a bill that is too large.",
  "Tagihan bilang": "The bill says",
