  "tanpa data emisi portofolio yang dapat diaudit, bank tak memenuhi syarat green bond/sustainability-linked loan berbunga rendah dari lender internasional": "without auditable portfolio emission data, a bank does not qualify for the low-interest green bonds/sustainability-linked loans offered by international lenders",
  "Tanpa data karbon yang kredibel, komoditas Indonesia berisiko didiskon harga — atau kehilangan akses ke pasar premium.": "Without credible carbon data, Indonesian commodities risk being discounted on price — or losing access to premium markets.",
  "Tanpa Glyiv": "Without Glyiv",
  "tanpa internet": "without internet",
  "Tanpa jejak karbon yang terlacak, bank menanggung biaya tersembunyi yang tidak pernah muncul sebagai baris anggaran: nasabah korporasi dengan intensitas karbon tinggi diam-diam menjadi risiko gagal bayar saat CBAM Uni Eropa dan pajak karbon domestik menekan margin mereka — namun bank tetap memberi harga kredit seolah risikonya nol. Aset yang dibiayai (pembangkit fosil, industri boros energi) berisiko menjadi stranded asset yang harus dicadangkan (CKPN) di kemudian hari. Sementara itu, bank kehilangan akses ke pendanaan hijau internasional yang bunganya lebih murah karena tidak punya data emisi portofolio yang dapat diaudit. Glyiv dirancang untuk mengubah 'risiko iklim yang tak terlihat' menjadi angka yang terlacak, agar penetapan harga kredit berpijak pada data — bukan pada asumsi.": "Without a tracked carbon footprint, a bank carries hidden costs that never appear as a budget line: corporate clients with high carbon intensity quietly become default risks as the EU's CBAM and domestic carbon taxes squeeze their margins — yet the bank still prices credit as if the risk were zero. Financed assets (fossil power plants, energy-hungry industry) risk becoming stranded assets that have to be provisioned for (CKPN) later on. Meanwhile, the bank loses access to cheaper international green funding because it has no auditable portfolio emissions data. Glyiv is designed to turn 'invisible climate risk' into a tracked figure, so that credit pricing rests on data — not on assumptions.",
  "Tanpa kartu kredit. Outlet langsung terbuka di konsolnya; meja & QR, menu, dan staf Anda atur di sana kapan saja.": "No credit card. The outlet opens straight into its console; tables & QR, menus, and staff are set there whenever you like.",
  "Tanpa LUC, default ≈ 9.660 tCO2e/tahun (CPO 8.800 + pupuk 860) ≈ ~439.000 pohon/tahun (~22 kgCO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Jika ada gambut, LUC bisa >70.000 tCO2e dan tak realistis dioffset — di sini reduksi (biogas + hentikan buka gambut) mutlak lebih dulu; offset hanya untuk residual.": "Without LUC, the default is ≈ 9,660 tCO2e/year (CPO 8,800 + fertiliser 860) ≈ ~439,000 trees/year (~22 kgCO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Where peat is involved, LUC can exceed >70,000 tCO2e and cannot realistically be offset — here reduction (biogas + stop clearing peat) absolutely comes first; offsets only for the residual.",
