  "Tersimpan di brankas yang hanya bisa dibuka akun Anda sendiri dan admin Glyiv, dan tidak bisa ditimpa setelah terunggah.": "Stored in a vault that only your own account and Glyiv admins can open, and it cannot be overwritten once uploaded.",
  "Tersimpan di perangkat lengkap dengan foto, titik, dan koordinat bila ada. Antrean terunggah sendiri saat kembali daring.": "Saved on the device together with the photo, the points, and the coordinates if any. The queue uploads itself once you are back online.",
  "Tersimpan sebagai": "Stored as",
