  "Tertarik kontribusi hijau": "Interested in green contributions",
  "Tertinggi": "Highest",
  "Terus terang: syarat regulasi untuk menerima pendaftaran pemilik lahan belum terpenuhi, jadi kami menundanya alih-alih membuka daftar tunggu yang tidak bisa kami tepati. Empat langkah di bawah adalah rencananya ⚠︎ — belum satu pun yang bisa Anda jalani hari ini.": "Plainly: the regulatory requirements for accepting landowner registration are not yet met, so we are holding it back rather than opening a waiting list we cannot honour. The four steps below are the plan ⚠︎ — not one of them is something you can go through today.",
  "Tetapi foto KTP-nya tersimpan utuh di arsip terkunci Glyiv, jadi angka pada foto itu tetap terbaca oleh tim peninjau — memang itu yang diperiksa.": "But the KTP photo is stored intact in a locked Glyiv archive, so the digits on that photo stay readable to the review team — that is exactly what is checked.",
  "Tiap aktivitas dikali faktor emisi tepercaya (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, DEFRA) untuk memperkirakan emisi yang terhindar; fallback EEIO (EXIOBASE) dipakai bila data spesifik belum ada.": "Each activity is multiplied by a trusted emission factor (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, DEFRA) to estimate the emissions avoided; an EEIO fallback (EXIOBASE) is used when specific data is not yet available.",
  "tiap belanja.": "with every purchase.",
  "Tiap fokus berdiri di atas data yang sama: transaksi nyata dari outlet pilot — dirancang untuk skala ribuan merchant.": "Every focus stands on the same data: real transactions from pilot outlets — designed to scale to thousands of merchants.",
  "Tiap hari muncul aksi kecil. Selesaikan, centang — Glyiv menghitung karbon yang terhindar, bersumber.": "A small action appears every day. Do it, tick it — Glyiv counts the carbon avoided, with sources.",
  "Tiap item dihitung emisinya otomatis — bukan sekadar laporan, tapi aset data level-item yang kelak bisa kamu lisensikan atau setor untuk kredit karbon.": "Every item's emissions are estimated automatically — not just a report, but an item-level data asset you may later license or submit toward carbon credits.",
  "Tiap item tersortir → kredit hijau masuk ke Glyiv Bank Sampah.": "Every sorted item → a green credit lands in Glyiv Waste Bank.",
  "Tiap kebiasaan hijau dihitung manfaat sehat + karbon yang dihindari.": "Every green habit is counted as a health benefit + carbon avoided.",
  "Tiap meja punya alamatnya sendiri: dua angka terakhir mengikuti nomor mejanya, jadi meja kedua berakhiran 02 dan meja ketiga 03. Stikernya dicetak dari tab Meja & QR setelah outlet dibuat.": "Each table has its own address: the last two digits follow its table number, so the second table ends in 02 and the third in 03. The stickers are printed from the Tables & QR tab once the outlet exists.",
  "Tiap meja punya QR sendiri": "Every table has its own QR",
  "Tiap meja punya QR sendiri, jadi pelanggan di lantai atas pesan tanpa turun. Kamu berpeluang hemat satu pos titik bayar penuh — langsung ke margin.": "Every table has its own QR, so upstairs customers order without coming down. You could save a whole pay-point station — straight into margin.",
  "tiap outlet dalam satu layar. Papan peringkat efisiensi menandai outlet boros lebih dulu, lalu menyarankan penghematan energi & pengurangan susut bahan yang konkret.": "every outlet on one screen. The efficiency leaderboard flags the wasteful outlets first, then suggests concrete energy savings & reductions in material loss.",
  "Tiap pembayaran—QRIS, top up, transfer—dipetakan ke faktor emisi via LCA berbasis aktivitas (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, Agribalyse, DEFRA, IPCC), dengan fallback EEIO berbasis pengeluaran (EXIOBASE) saat rincian item belum tersedia.": "Each payment—QRIS, top-up, transfer—is mapped to emission factors via activity-based LCA (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, Agribalyse, DEFRA, IPCC), with a spend-based EEIO fallback (EXIOBASE) when item detail is not yet available.",
  "Tiap pembelian menanam": "Every purchase plants",
  "Tiap pengukuran yang berhasil diunggah menambah 15 poin ke dompet Green Assets Anda — poin yang sama yang dipakai membeli perlengkapan perawatan di aplikasi Hijau. Poin adalah skor permainan: tidak bisa dicairkan, bukan kredit karbon. Batas 20 pengukuran berpoin per hari hanya ditegakkan di aplikasi ini (bukan di server) ⚠︎.": "Every measurement uploaded successfully adds 15 points to your Green Assets wallet — the same points used to buy care equipment in the Hijau app. Points are a game score: they cannot be cashed out and they are not carbon credits. The limit of 20 point-earning measurements per day is enforced in this app only (not on the server) ⚠︎.",
  "Tiap pesanan": "Every order",
  "Tiap petak punya koordinat, batas yang dipetakan, luas terhitung, dan spesies. Pendaftaran pemiliknya menyusul setelah syarat regulasi terpenuhi ⚠︎.": "Every plot has coordinates, mapped boundaries, a computed area, and species. Owner registration follows once the regulatory requirements are met ⚠︎.",
  "Tiap proyek menunjukkan jumlah pohon, estimasi serapan tahunan, kerapatan tutupan (NDVI), dan grafik pertumbuhannya. Kalau tutupan turun, angkanya ikut turun — tak ada tempat bersembunyi.": "Every project shows the tree count, the annual absorption estimate, canopy cover density (NDVI), and its growth chart. If the cover falls, the figures fall with it — nowhere to hide.",
  "Tiap resep dipetakan ke faktor emisi bahan lewat activity-LCA (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, Agribalyse), dengan fallback spend-based EXIOBASE saat data bahan belum lengkap.": "Each recipe is mapped to ingredient emission factors through activity-LCA (ecoinvent, Poore & Nemecek 2018, Agribalyse), with a spend-based EXIOBASE fallback when ingredient data is incomplete.",
  "Tiap titik bayar,": "Every point of payment,",
  "Tiap transaksi baru = data karbon baru. Bukan proyek sekali jalan — mesin yang terus berdetak.": "Every new transaction = new carbon data. Not a one-off project — an engine that keeps beating.",
  "Tiap transaksi dipetakan ke kategori & faktor emisi Glyiv (spend-based EEIO / activity-based bila detail tersedia).": "Every transaction is mapped to a Glyiv category & emission factor (spend-based EEIO / activity-based where the detail is available).",
