  "Total default ~1.676 tCO2e/tahun setara ~76.180 pohon/tahun (~22 kg CO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Offset hanya untuk sisa setelah pengurangan gas anestesi & efisiensi energi — hindari klaim 'rumah sakit netral karbon'; gunakan 'jejak karbon terlacak & lintasan pengurangan' sesuai postur jujur.": "The default total ~1,676 tCO2e/year equals ~76,180 trees/year (~22 kg CO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Offsets only for what remains after cutting anaesthetic gases & energy efficiency — avoid the 'carbon neutral hospital' claim; use 'tracked carbon footprint & reduction trajectory', in line with the honest posture.",
  "Total default ~134 tCO2e/tahun setara ~6.090 pohon/tahun (~22 kg CO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Karena skala UMKM-menengah, sisa emisi realistis di-offset sebagian via program reforestasi lokal terverifikasi — sampaikan sebagai 'kontribusi iklim terlacak', bukan 'kopi netral karbon'.": "Default total ~134 tCO2e/year, equivalent to ~6,090 trees/year (~22 kg CO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). Given the small-and-medium enterprise scale, the remaining emissions are realistically offset in part through verified local reforestation programmes — communicate this as a 'tracked climate contribution', not as 'carbon neutral coffee'.",
  "Total default ~674,5 tCO2e/tahun setara ~30.660 pohon/tahun (~22 kg CO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Untuk instansi, offset diposisikan sebagai pelengkap setelah efisiensi energi & elektrifikasi armada — bukan pengganti target pengurangan. Framing: 'jejak karbon instansi terlacak & dikurangi', bukan klaim netralitas.": "The default total ~674.5 tCO2e/year equals ~30,660 trees/year (~22 kg CO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). For public institutions, offsetting is positioned as a complement after energy efficiency & fleet electrification — not a substitute for reduction targets. Framing: 'the institution's carbon footprint is tracked & reduced', not a neutrality claim.",
  "Total default hanya ~5,6 tCO2e/tahun setara ~256 pohon/tahun (~22 kg CO2e/pohon/tahun ⚠︎). Pada skala UMKM ini, offset penuh via program reforestasi lokal terverifikasi realistis dan terjangkau — sampaikan sebagai 'kontribusi iklim toko terlacak', tetap hindari klaim absolut 'netral karbon' tanpa audit.": "The default total is only ~5.6 tCO2e/year, equal to ~256 trees/year (~22 kg CO2e/tree/year ⚠︎). At this MSME scale, offsetting the whole footprint through a verified local reforestation programme is realistic and affordable — present it as 'the shop's tracked climate contribution', and still avoid the absolute 'carbon neutral' claim without an audit.",
