  "UU HPP 2021 menetapkan tarif pajak karbon minimal Rp30.000 per ton untuk PLTU batu bara. Tapi tanggal berlakunya terus digeser — dan hingga kini ⚠︎ belum efektif berjalan.": "The 2021 HPP Law sets a minimum carbon tax rate of Rp30,000 per tonne for coal-fired power plants. But its effective date keeps being pushed back — and to date ⚠︎ it is not yet in force.",
