  "Versi baru sudah selesai dibangun dan sidiknya sudah dipasang di kartu masing-masing, tetapi berkas di tautan unduhan belum diganti. Kalau Anda mencocokkan sekarang, hasilnya akan berbeda — itu bukan tanda berkasnya disusupi.": "The new version has finished building and its fingerprints are already on each card, but the file behind the download link has not been swapped yet. If you check it now the result will differ — that is not a sign the file has been tampered with.",
