  "Visi appchain khusus sebagai registry karbon: biaya rendah, throughput tinggi, standar MRV tertanam sejak protokol. Masih arah — belum ada whitepaper teknis, testnet, atau kode. Jalur realistis kini: bangun di atas Ethereum dulu.": "The vision of a dedicated appchain as a carbon registry: low cost, high throughput, MRV standards embedded at the protocol level. Still a direction — there is no technical whitepaper, testnet, or code yet. The realistic path for now: build on Ethereum first.",
