  "weighted average carbon intensity & financed emissions per emiten, sektor, dan dana — mengikuti kerangka PCAF & IFRS S2": "weighted average carbon intensity & financed emissions per issuer, sector, and fund — following the PCAF & IFRS S2 frameworks",
  "Weighted-average carbon intensity (WACI) portofolio investasi mendominasi >99% jejak — operasional kantor nyaris tak relevan. Merotasi ~10% AUM dari sektor fosil ke green/sustainability bonds dapat memangkas jejak terbiayai ~15-30% tanpa mengubah profil risiko-return secara material. Laporkan per PCAF & TCFD/ISSB, dan lacak per-emiten (data quality score) alih-alih rata-rata sektor.": "The weighted-average carbon intensity (WACI) of the investment portfolio dominates >99% of the footprint — office operations are barely relevant. Rotating ~10% of AUM out of fossil sectors into green/sustainability bonds can cut the financed footprint by ~15-30% without materially changing the risk-return profile. Report under PCAF & TCFD/ISSB, and track per issuer (data quality score) rather than sector averages.",
