  "yang selalu ditampilkan sebagai rentang beserta tier datanya; ia bukan pengukuran dan bukan hasil verifikasi pihak ketiga, dan sertifikasi/MRV/registri tetap peta jalan. Padanan pohon adalah": "which is always shown as a range together with its data tier; it is not a measurement and not the result of third-party verification, and certification/MRV/registry remain roadmap. The tree equivalent is",
  "Yang sering terlewat: CBAM bukan sekadar biaya kepatuhan, tapi": "What is often missed: CBAM is not merely a compliance cost, but",
  "Yang sudah bisa dipakai sekarang adalah alat pemantauannya: gambar batas sebuah petak, lihat luas terhitung dan estimasi serapan berentang ⚠︎, lalu simpan ke daftar pantauan Anda. Sisanya — pohon virtual, poin, dan pasar kebutuhan perusahaan — adalah simulasi yang ditandai jelas di dalam aplikasi. Sertifikasi pihak ketiga serta pencatatan ke registri karbon (SRN-PPI, IDXCarbon, Verra) masih peta jalan ⚠︎.": "What is usable right now is the monitoring tool: draw the boundary of a plot, see the computed area and a ranged absorption estimate ⚠︎, then save it to your watchlist. The rest — virtual trees, points, and the corporate demand marketplace — is a simulation, clearly labelled inside the app. Third-party certification and recording into carbon registries (SRN-PPI, IDXCarbon, Verra) are still on the roadmap ⚠︎.",
