  "Booking meja dari luar outlet muncul di sini secara langsung. Nyalakan “Terima pesanan meja dari luar outlet” di tab Website supaya pelanggan bisa memesannya.": "Table bookings made from outside the outlet appear here live. Turn on “Accept table bookings from outside the outlet” in the Website tab so customers can book one.",
  "Sesi Anda sudah berakhir. Masuk ulang lebih dulu, lalu unggah logonya lagi.": "Your session has ended. Sign in again first, then upload the logo once more.",
  "Sambungan terputus di tengah unggahan. Periksa koneksi internet, lalu tekan Coba lagi — logo belum terkirim.": "The connection dropped mid-upload. Check your internet, then press Try again — the logo has not been sent.",
  "Unggahan dibatalkan. Logo belum tersimpan.": "Upload cancelled. The logo has not been saved.",
  "Ruang penyimpanan Glyiv sedang penuh. Ini masalah di sisi kami, bukan gambar Anda — beri tahu admin.": "Glyiv storage is full. This is a problem on our side, not with your image — please tell an admin.",
