  "Pengenalan foto sedang mati: tidak ada model penglihatan aktif di akun Groq Glyiv.": "Photo recognition is down: no vision model is active on the Glyiv Groq account.",
  "Ini di sisi kami, bukan di perangkat Anda. Jalur “ketik nama bahan” di bawah tetap jalan dan memakai pustaka faktor yang sama.": "This is on our side, not on your device. The “type the ingredient name” path below still works and uses the same factor library.",
  "Alamat halaman ini belum diizinkan oleh proxy Glyiv.": "This page's address is not yet allowed by the Glyiv proxy.",
  "Buka lewat glyiv.github.io atau glyiv.web.app. Kalau ini server uji, tambahkan origin-nya ke ALLOW_ORIGINS di chat-proxy-worker.js lalu deploy ulang worker-nya.": "Open it via glyiv.github.io or glyiv.web.app. If this is a test server, add its origin to ALLOW_ORIGINS in chat-proxy-worker.js and redeploy the worker.",
