  "nama barang, kategori, perkiraan gram, keyakinan": "item name, category, estimated grams, confidence",
  ", karena angka karangan model tak terlacak ke apa pun.": ", because a figure invented by the model is not tracked to anything.",
  "Nama barang dicocokkan ke pustaka faktor emisi Glyiv (Poore & Nemecek, ADEME Agribalyse, ESDM/DJK) di perangkat. Skor kecocokan ditampilkan apa adanya.": "The item name is matched against Glyiv's emission-factor library (Poore & Nemecek, ADEME Agribalyse, ESDM/DJK) on the device. The match score is shown as it is.",
  "Bila keyakinan rendah, bahannya di luar pustaka, atau dua faktor sama kuat dengan nilai berbeda, halaman ini": "If confidence is low, the ingredient falls outside the library, or two equally strong factors give different values, this page",
  "— ia meminta konfirmasi atau berkata belum bisa diperkirakan.": "— it asks for confirmation, or says it cannot be estimated yet.",
  "Beri rentang & tier": "Give a range & tier",
  "Setiap angka membawa rentang ketidakpastian & label tier data (T2 faktor nasional → T4 proksi). ⚠︎ Belum ada satu baris pun yang mencapai T1.": "Every figure carries an uncertainty range & a data-tier label (T2 national factor → T4 proxy). ⚠︎ Not a single row reaches T1 yet.",
