  "⚠︎ Estimasi, bukan sertifikasi. Titik terlemahnya:": "⚠︎ An estimate, not a certification. Its weakest point:",
  "berat dari foto": "weight from a photo",
  "— model menebak massa tanpa acuan skala, dan seluruh angka berskala lurus dengan tebakan itu. Pustaka faktornya condong Eropa/global sehingga faktor Indonesia bisa berbeda, dan sebagian besar barisnya tier T3–T4 (belum ada T1). Jalur berbasis harga": "— the model guesses mass without a scale reference, and every figure scales linearly with that guess. Its factor library leans European/global, so Indonesian factors may differ, and most of its rows sit at tier T3–T4 (none at T1 yet). The price-based path is",
  "sengaja dimatikan": "deliberately switched off",
  ": faktor EEIO/EXIOBASE Indonesia belum ditarik dari rilis resmi, jadi angka spend-based tidak dihitung dari ingatan. Mendukung \"kontribusi/jejak terlacak\" untuk imbalan Glyiv, bukan klaim netral karbon.": ": Indonesia's EEIO/EXIOBASE factors have not been pulled from official releases, so spend-based figures are not computed from memory. It supports a \"tracked contribution/footprint\" for Glyiv rewards, not a carbon-neutral claim.",
