  "Bintang, komentar, nama yang ditulis pelanggan, dan pesanan yang mendasarinya. Ulasan hanya bisa ditulis oleh akun yang benar-benar punya pesanan di outlet itu.": "Stars, comments, the name written by the customer, and the order behind it. A review can only be written by an account that genuinely has an order at that outlet.",
