  "Hanya sepuluh medan: diameter, tinggi, spesies, estimasi CO₂e, lintang, bujur, metode, catatan, waktu pengukuran, dan waktu unggah.": "Only ten fields: diameter, height, species, CO₂e estimate, latitude, longitude, method, notes, measurement time, and upload time.",
