  ", dan server kami menolak dokumen yang memuat medan di luar sepuluh itu — jadi tidak ada jalan menyelipkan data gambar ke dalamnya, sekarang maupun nanti.": ", and our server rejects any document containing a field outside those ten — so there is no way to slip image data into it, now or later.",
  "4.3 Kenapa fotonya kami tahan.": "4.3 Why we hold the photos back.",
  "Foto lapangan sering memuat wajah orang, plang, dan lokasi persis. Ia berguna bagi Anda sebagai bukti kerja; ia tidak dibutuhkan siapa pun di Glyiv.": "Field photos often contain people's faces, signage, and exact locations. They are useful to you as proof of work; they are not needed by anyone at Glyiv.",
