  "5.3 Jejak perawatan & dompet poin.": "5.3 Care trail & points wallet.",
  "Untuk tiap pohon virtual yang Anda sentuh: kapan terakhir disiram, berapa kali, dan angka kesehatannya. Dompet menyimpan poin, jumlah penyiraman, dan tingkat.": "For every virtual tree you touch: when it was last watered, how many times, and its health score. The wallet stores points, watering count, and level.",
