  "5.4 Ringkasan untuk konsol.": "5.4 Summary for the console.",
  "Supaya tim kami bisa mengurus tingkat pengguna tanpa membuka petanya, kami menyimpan": "So that our team can manage user levels without opening their maps, we store",
  "angka ringkasnya saja": "only the summary figures",
  "di tempat terpisah: berapa area, total luas, poin, jumlah penyiraman, dan tingkat. Tidak ada koordinat, nama area, benih, indeks kehijauan, maupun spesies di sana.": "in a separate place: how many areas, total area, points, watering count, and level. There are no coordinates, area names, seeds, greenness indexes, or species there.",
  "5.5 Pendaftaran sukarelawan.": "5.5 Volunteer registration.",
  "Bila Anda mendaftar sebagai sukarelawan survei, yang tersimpan adalah nama, satu kontak, nama daerah, pengalaman, dan status penilaiannya.": "If you register as a survey volunteer, what is stored is your name, one contact, a region name, experience, and the assessment status.",
