  ". Bila kelak dibuka, kebijakan ini diperbarui lebih dulu dan diberi nomor versi baru.": ". If one is opened later, this policy will be updated first and given a new version number.",
  "7.3 Asisten Gly.": "7.3 The Gly assistant.",
  "Saat Anda mengirim pesan kepada Gly, yang dikirim keluar adalah: teks yang Anda ketik, sampai sepuluh giliran terakhir percakapan di tab itu, dan": "When you send a message to Gly, what goes out is: the text you type, up to the last ten turns of the conversation in that tab, and the",
  "konteks halaman": "page context",
  "berupa judul halaman, judul besarnya, ringkasan meta, dan alamat halamannya. Tidak ada pengenal akun, alamat surel, atau isi dokumen Anda yang ikut.": "consisting of the page title, its main heading, the meta description, and the page address. No account identifier, email address, or content of your documents goes with it.",
  "Percakapan itu melewati proksi kami di Cloudflare lalu diteruskan ke penyedia model bahasa": "That conversation passes through our proxy at Cloudflare and is then forwarded to the language model provider",
  "Glyiv tidak menyimpan percakapan Gly di basis datanya": "Glyiv does not store Gly conversations in its database",
  "; riwayat percakapan hidup di memori tab Anda dan hilang saat tab ditutup. Yang tidak bisa kami janjikan adalah pencatatan di sisi Cloudflare dan Groq — itu tunduk pada kebijakan mereka, dan karena itu": "; conversation history lives in your tab's memory and disappears when the tab is closed. What we cannot promise is logging on the Cloudflare and Groq side — that is subject to their policies, and for that reason",
  "jangan mengetik data pribadi atau rahasia usaha ke dalam kotak obrolan": "do not type personal data or business secrets into the chat box",
  "Sebagian besar pemrosesan kami berdiri di atas": "Most of our processing rests on",
