  "Kami tidak menulis “mitra tepercaya” — itu tidak memberi tahu apa pun. Di bawah ini nama perusahaannya, apa yang mereka terima, dan kenapa. Dua di antaranya perlu Anda tahu meski terasa sepele:": "We do not write “trusted partners” — that tells you nothing. Below are the company names, what they receive, and why. Two of them you need to know about even though they seem trivial:",
