  "Anda berhak tahu, melihat, memperbaiki, menghapus, menarik persetujuan, membatasi, memindahkan, dan menuntut ganti rugi. Sebagian bisa Anda kerjakan sendiri di aplikasi tanpa menghubungi siapa pun — itu yang paling cepat. Sisanya: kirim surel ke": "You have the right to know, to see, to rectify, to erase, to withdraw consent, to restrict, to port, and to claim compensation. Some of this you can do yourself in the app without contacting anyone — that is the fastest route. For the rest: send an email to",
